1
00:00:30,560 --> 00:00:33,720
<font color="#ffffff">METALLIC THRUMMING</font>

2
00:00:39,960 --> 00:00:42,080
<font color="#ffffff">CLICKING</font>

3
00:00:57,480 --> 00:00:59,000
<font color="#ffffff">RUSTLING</font>

4
00:01:00,120 --> 00:01:02,800
<font color="#ffffff">You there, who are you?</font>

5
00:01:08,280 --> 00:01:09,800
<font color="#ffff00">Doctor!</font>

6
00:01:11,600 --> 00:01:13,200
<font color="#ffff00">Is that really you?</font>

7
00:01:13,200 --> 00:01:14,760
<font color="#ffffff">Peri?</font>

8
00:01:14,760 --> 00:01:16,400
<font color="#ffff00">Yeah.</font>

9
00:01:16,400 --> 00:01:19,080
<font color="#ffffff">After all these years!</font>

10
00:01:19,080 --> 00:01:21,000
<font color="#ffffff">THEY LAUGH</font>

11
00:01:22,280 --> 00:01:23,840
<font color="#ffffff">Oh...</font>

12
00:01:26,360 --> 00:01:28,320
<font color="#ffffff">THEY CHUCKLE</font>

13
00:01:28,320 --> 00:01:29,880
<font color="#ffff00">Doctor!</font>

14
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:32,960
<font color="#ffffff">THEY SIGH</font>

15
00:01:34,680 --> 00:01:36,600
<font color="#ffffff">Let me look at you.</font>

16
00:01:36,600 --> 00:01:39,520
<font color="#ffffff">The warrior queen!</font>

17
00:01:39,520 --> 00:01:42,320
<font color="#ffff00">It's so good to see you again.</font>

18
00:01:43,560 --> 00:01:45,600
<font color="#ffff00">You got old.</font><font color="#ffffff"> Mmm!</font>

19
00:01:45,600 --> 00:01:47,160
<font color="#ffffff">And bigger!</font>

20
00:01:47,160 --> 00:01:48,880
<font color="#ffffff">And beardier!</font>

21
00:01:48,880 --> 00:01:50,240
<font color="#ffff00">Ohh.</font>

22
00:01:51,920 --> 00:01:54,920
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, time marches on, Peri, even for</font>
<font color="#ffffff">a Time Lord.</font>

23
00:01:54,920 --> 00:01:57,240
<font color="#ffffff">It really has no respect.</font>

24
00:01:57,240 --> 00:01:58,920
<font color="#ffffff">But you...</font>

25
00:01:58,920 --> 00:02:02,280
<font color="#ffffff">You've filled your years with</font>
<font color="#ffffff">adventures</font>

26
00:02:02,280 --> 00:02:04,400
<font color="#ffffff">and legends in the making!</font>

27
00:02:04,400 --> 00:02:06,600
<font color="#ffff00">You heard about that, did you?</font>

28
00:02:06,600 --> 00:02:09,400
<font color="#ffffff">I've heard minstrels sing songs of</font>
<font color="#ffffff">the Warrior Queen</font>

29
00:02:09,400 --> 00:02:12,760
<font color="#ffffff">from the Scorpion Nebula to the</font>
<font color="#ffffff">outer rings</font>

30
00:02:12,760 --> 00:02:14,680
<font color="#ffffff">of the Medusa Cascade.</font>

31
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:18,480
<font color="#ffffff">Some of them were very catchy.</font>

32
00:02:18,480 --> 00:02:20,560
<font color="#ffffff"># Bom-bom-bah! #</font>

33
00:02:20,560 --> 00:02:22,880
<font color="#ffff00">I'm glad you approve.</font>

34
00:02:22,880 --> 00:02:24,320
<font color="#ffffff">Ah...</font>

35
00:02:24,320 --> 00:02:29,280
<font color="#ffff00">I've done things a girl from</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Fells Point could never dream of.</font>

36
00:02:29,280 --> 00:02:32,400
<font color="#ffffff">You lived the life intended for you,</font>

37
00:02:32,400 --> 00:02:36,680
<font color="#ffffff">by time, from that day in Lanzarote,</font>

38
00:02:36,680 --> 00:02:40,000
<font color="#ffffff">and your story is far from over.</font>

39
00:02:41,840 --> 00:02:43,720
<font color="#ffff00">For both of us, Doctor.</font>

40
00:02:43,720 --> 00:02:45,440
<font color="#ffffff">Maybe.</font>

41
00:02:46,880 --> 00:02:48,600
<font color="#ffffff">Maybe.</font>

42
00:02:48,600 --> 00:02:51,760
<font color="#ffffff">I was wondering what had brought you</font>
<font color="#ffffff">here.</font>

43
00:02:51,760 --> 00:02:53,960
<font color="#ffff00">I was kind of wondering that myself.</font>

44
00:02:53,960 --> 00:02:57,280
<font color="#ffff00">I mean, it looks like the TARDIS.</font>

45
00:02:57,280 --> 00:03:00,440
<font color="#ffffff">Much more on the inside?</font><font color="#ffff00"> Yeah.</font>

46
00:03:00,440 --> 00:03:02,120
<font color="#ffffff">Cosy, though, isn't it?</font>

47
00:03:02,120 --> 00:03:06,280
<font color="#ffffff">This is a remembered TARDIS, Peri.</font>

48
00:03:06,280 --> 00:03:09,800
<font color="#ffffff">All those stories we shared,</font>

49
00:03:09,800 --> 00:03:12,320
<font color="#ffffff">their memories live on here,</font>

50
00:03:12,320 --> 00:03:14,920
<font color="#ffffff">like ripples on an eternal pond,</font>

51
00:03:14,920 --> 00:03:17,600
<font color="#ffffff">forever moving, forever repeating,</font>

52
00:03:17,600 --> 00:03:21,480
<font color="#ffffff">and sometimes those memories come</font>
<font color="#ffffff">back to us</font>

53
00:03:21,480 --> 00:03:23,800
<font color="#ffffff">through space and time</font>

54
00:03:23,800 --> 00:03:26,080
<font color="#ffffff">when we least expect them.</font>

55
00:03:26,080 --> 00:03:28,080
<font color="#ffffff">RUMBLING</font>

56
00:03:39,600 --> 00:03:43,200
<font color="#ffff00">And that's how I got here now?</font>

57
00:03:43,200 --> 00:03:45,120
<font color="#ffffff">You've always been here.</font>

58
00:03:45,120 --> 00:03:47,360
<font color="#ffffff">You never left.</font>

59
00:03:47,360 --> 00:03:51,280
<font color="#ffffff">The TARDIS never forgets.</font>

60
00:03:53,040 --> 00:03:54,720
<font color="#ffffff">And neither did I.</font>

61
00:03:56,280 --> 00:03:58,800
<font color="#ffff00">I didn't forget you either.</font><font color="#ffffff"> No.</font>

62
00:03:58,800 --> 00:04:03,480
<font color="#ffff00">Every night, I would look up at the</font>
<font color="#ffff00">stars and wonder</font>

63
00:04:03,480 --> 00:04:07,400
<font color="#ffff00">which one you were spinning round</font>
<font color="#ffff00">in the TARDIS,</font>

64
00:04:07,400 --> 00:04:09,200
<font color="#ffff00">and I'd ask myself...</font>

65
00:04:11,360 --> 00:04:13,600
<font color="#ffff00">"..Will I ever see him again?"</font>

66
00:04:16,920 --> 00:04:18,880
<font color="#ffffff">And here we are!</font>

67
00:04:18,880 --> 00:04:20,960
<font color="#ffffff">Older and wiser.</font>

68
00:04:22,160 --> 00:04:24,200
<font color="#ffffff">Two adventurers...and friends...</font>

69
00:04:26,000 --> 00:04:29,880
<font color="#ffffff">..reunited across light years</font>
<font color="#ffffff">and time.</font>

70
00:04:31,400 --> 00:04:34,440
<font color="#ffffff">It is so good to see you again.</font>

71
00:04:34,440 --> 00:04:36,280
<font color="#ffff00">And you too.</font>

72
00:04:38,560 --> 00:04:42,600
<font color="#ffff00">I guess we made a whole lot of</font>
<font color="#ffff00">memories,</font>

73
00:04:42,600 --> 00:04:45,800
<font color="#ffff00">though, if I'm honest, some I'd</font>
<font color="#ffff00">rather forget.</font>

74
00:04:45,800 --> 00:04:48,920
<font color="#ffffff">You mean Sil and Kiv?</font>

75
00:04:48,920 --> 00:04:53,200
<font color="#ffffff">Not the most likeable lifeforms in</font>
<font color="#ffffff">the universe.</font>

76
00:04:53,200 --> 00:04:55,080
<font color="#ffff00">You can say that again.</font>

77
00:04:55,080 --> 00:04:58,760
<font color="#ffffff">But that first encounter on Varos</font>

78
00:04:58,760 --> 00:05:02,800
<font color="#ffffff">was a prelude to your whole life as</font>
<font color="#ffffff">the Warrior Queen.</font>

79
00:05:04,200 --> 00:05:05,600
<font color="#ffff00">Yeah, I guess.</font>

80
00:05:05,600 --> 00:05:07,280
<font color="#ffff00">In a way.</font>

81
00:05:07,280 --> 00:05:09,120
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, there's no doubt.</font>

82
00:05:09,120 --> 00:05:15,400
<font color="#ffffff">Good can come from even the darkest</font>
<font color="#ffffff">of places.</font>

83
00:05:23,200 --> 00:05:25,680
<font color="#ffffff">WHIRRING</font>

84
00:05:36,560 --> 00:05:38,960
<font color="#ffffff">HE GROANS</font>

85
00:05:48,280 --> 00:05:50,600
<font color="#ffffff">HE SCREAMS</font>

86
00:05:54,760 --> 00:05:57,200
<font color="#ffffff">HE GASPS</font>

87
00:06:08,160 --> 00:06:10,360
<font color="#00ffff">Not him again?</font><font color="#ffff00"> Yeah!</font>

88
00:06:17,120 --> 00:06:20,240
<font color="#00ffff">COMDIV must be running short</font>
<font color="#00ffff">of people to laserise.</font>

89
00:06:20,240 --> 00:06:21,680
<font color="#ffff00">Yeah.</font>

90
00:06:21,680 --> 00:06:23,280
<font color="#ffffff">HE GROANS</font>

91
00:06:24,920 --> 00:06:28,960
<font color="#00ffff">Rubbish! He's not hurt,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">he's only acting.</font><font color="#ffff00"> Never!</font>

92
00:06:28,960 --> 00:06:31,800
<font color="#ffffff">HE YELLS</font>

93
00:06:41,480 --> 00:06:44,200
<font color="#00ffff">Is this all?</font>
<font color="#ffff00">It's what they sent.</font>

94
00:06:44,200 --> 00:06:46,760
<font color="#00ffff">How can I work, dig on this?</font>

95
00:06:46,760 --> 00:06:50,280
<font color="#00ffff">It wouldn't fill a clinker-mole's</font>
<font color="#00ffff">belly, let alone a worker's!</font>

96
00:06:50,280 --> 00:06:54,000
<font color="#ffff00">There's shortages,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">maybe more to come.</font>

97
00:07:04,320 --> 00:07:06,440
<font color="#ffff00">Governor's punch-in vote tonight.</font>

98
00:07:06,440 --> 00:07:11,280
<font color="#00ffff">Voting, voting! This Governor calls</font>
<font color="#00ffff">a punch-in every time he wants to</font>
<font color="#00ffff">change trousers!</font>

99
00:07:11,280 --> 00:07:15,360
<font color="#00ffff">Sooner he's out, the better.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">What would the next one do</font>
<font color="#ffff00">different?</font>

100
00:07:15,360 --> 00:07:18,880
<font color="#00ffff">Everything! Anything!</font>

101
00:07:18,880 --> 00:07:21,160
<font color="#00ffff">What is this I'm eating, Etta?</font>

102
00:07:21,160 --> 00:07:23,880
<font color="#ffff00">How should I know? Just get it</font>
<font color="#ffff00">out the dispenser!</font>

103
00:07:23,880 --> 00:07:25,560
<font color="#ffff00">Didn't have a label.</font>

104
00:07:27,040 --> 00:07:29,280
<font color="#00ffff">Get off!</font>

105
00:07:29,280 --> 00:07:33,000
<font color="#00ffff">I want to chuck it at the screen</font>
<font color="#00ffff">when your beloved Governor</font>
<font color="#00ffff">begs my vote.</font>

106
00:07:33,000 --> 00:07:37,640
<font color="#ffff00">Attacking COM-TEC property</font>
<font color="#ffff00">can bring loss of viewing rights.</font>

107
00:07:37,640 --> 00:07:40,240
<font color="#ffff00">Way you're thinking,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">you'll be in that one's place.</font>

108
00:07:43,640 --> 00:07:45,720
<font color="#00ffff">Why have they stopped?</font>

109
00:07:45,720 --> 00:07:50,040
<font color="#00ffff">It's pathetic! When did they last</font>
<font color="#00ffff">show something worth watching, eh?</font>

110
00:07:50,040 --> 00:07:53,360
<font color="#00ffff">When was the last decent execution?</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Last week!</font>

111
00:07:53,360 --> 00:07:55,240
<font color="#00ffff">What?</font><font color="#ffff00"> The blind man?</font>

112
00:07:55,240 --> 00:07:56,600
<font color="#00ffff">That was a repeat!</font>

113
00:07:56,600 --> 00:07:59,640
<font color="#ffff00">It wasn't! You're thinking of</font>
<font color="#ffff00">that infiltrator.</font>

114
00:07:59,640 --> 00:08:02,680
<font color="#ffff00">He wasn't blind.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Not at the beginning, anyway.</font>

115
00:08:02,680 --> 00:08:04,760
<font color="#00ffff">Yes, he was!</font>

116
00:08:04,760 --> 00:08:08,320
<font color="#00ffff">I'm going to sleep.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Can't, you've got to vote.</font>

117
00:08:08,320 --> 00:08:09,600
<font color="#00ffff">Do it for me.</font>

118
00:08:09,600 --> 00:08:12,520
<font color="#ffff00">Do you want POL CORPS</font>
<font color="#ffff00">calling here?</font>

119
00:08:12,520 --> 00:08:14,400
<font color="#ffff00">Do you, Arak?</font>

120
00:08:14,400 --> 00:08:17,320
<font color="#00ffff">How would they know it</font>
<font color="#00ffff">wasn't me voting?</font>

121
00:08:17,320 --> 00:08:19,200
<font color="#ffff00">I'd tell 'em!</font>

122
00:08:23,920 --> 00:08:25,880
<font color="#ffffff">That's it!</font>

123
00:08:25,880 --> 00:08:30,760
<font color="#ffff00">I don't believe it!</font><font color="#ffffff"> I haven't told</font>
<font color="#ffffff">you what I've done yet!</font>

124
00:08:30,760 --> 00:08:33,960
<font color="#ffff00">You sound confident.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">I don't want to know!</font>

125
00:08:33,960 --> 00:08:35,840
<font color="#ffffff">What is the matter with you?</font>

126
00:08:35,840 --> 00:08:40,040
<font color="#ffff00">Every time you sound confident</font>
<font color="#ffff00">nowadays, something terrible seems</font>
<font color="#ffff00">to happen.</font>

127
00:08:40,040 --> 00:08:41,360
<font color="#ffffff">Does it?</font>

128
00:08:42,600 --> 00:08:44,320
<font color="#ffffff">What do you mean?</font>

129
00:08:44,320 --> 00:08:48,000
<font color="#ffff00">Well, since we left Telos, you've</font>
<font color="#ffff00">caused three electrical fires,</font>

130
00:08:48,000 --> 00:08:51,680
<font color="#ffff00">a total power failure and a near</font>
<font color="#ffff00">collision with a storm of asteroids.</font>

131
00:08:51,680 --> 00:08:56,680
<font color="#ffff00">Not only that! You've twice managed</font>
<font color="#ffff00">to get lost in the TARDIS</font>
<font color="#ffff00">corridors,</font>

132
00:08:56,680 --> 00:09:01,480
<font color="#ffff00">wiped the memory of the flight</font>
<font color="#ffff00">computer and jettisoned</font>
<font color="#ffff00">three-quarters of the storage hold!</font>

133
00:09:01,480 --> 00:09:04,200
<font color="#ffff00">You even burned dinner last night.</font>

134
00:09:04,200 --> 00:09:06,680
<font color="#ffffff">I have never said I was perfect!</font>

135
00:09:06,680 --> 00:09:10,920
<font color="#ffff00">If you recall, I was</font>
<font color="#ffff00">supposed to have a cold supper!</font>

136
00:09:10,920 --> 00:09:13,200
<font color="#ffffff">That was an unfortunate accident!</font>

137
00:09:15,160 --> 00:09:17,680
<font color="#00ffff">You're a reasonable man.</font>

138
00:09:17,680 --> 00:09:22,760
<font color="#00ffff">Lower the price</font>
<font color="#00ffff">of your commodity a little, please.</font>

139
00:09:22,760 --> 00:09:26,200
<font color="#00ff00">My people deserve</font>
<font color="#00ff00">fair prices for the Zeiton-7 ore.</font>

140
00:09:26,200 --> 00:09:28,680
<font color="#00ffff">Who else will buy from you,</font>

141
00:09:28,680 --> 00:09:33,360
<font color="#00ffff">if my corporation withdraws</font>
<font color="#00ffff">its contract?</font>

142
00:09:33,360 --> 00:09:36,240
<font color="#00ff00">We'll have to find other outlets,</font>
<font color="#00ff00">I should think.</font>

143
00:09:36,240 --> 00:09:41,320
<font color="#00ffff">You are not a rich planet.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Zeiton is all you have to sell.</font>

144
00:09:41,320 --> 00:09:43,160
<font color="#00ff00">There are other exports.</font>

145
00:09:43,160 --> 00:09:47,000
<font color="#00ff00">We're expanding into entertainments</font>
<font color="#00ff00">and communications with some</font>
<font color="#00ff00">success.</font>

146
00:09:47,000 --> 00:09:49,760
<font color="#00ffff">How?</font><font color="#00ff00"> The Punishment Dome.</font>

147
00:09:49,760 --> 00:09:51,840
<font color="#00ff00">We sell tapes of what happens there.</font>

148
00:09:51,840 --> 00:09:56,200
<font color="#ffffff">CHUCKLES</font>

149
00:09:51,840 --> 00:09:56,200
<font color="#00ffff">That is enterprising!</font>

150
00:09:57,240 --> 00:10:01,160
<font color="#00ffff">Your idea, Governor?</font><font color="#00ff00"> Yes.</font>

151
00:10:02,200 --> 00:10:06,560
<font color="#00ffff">Are they really disturbing,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">these videos you sell?</font>

152
00:10:06,560 --> 00:10:09,960
<font color="#00ff00">They show what befalls those who</font>
<font color="#00ff00">refuse to obey the laws</font>

153
00:10:09,960 --> 00:10:11,960
<font color="#00ff00">of the people of Varos.</font>

154
00:10:11,960 --> 00:10:16,680
<font color="#00ffff">Torture, blindness, executions?</font>

155
00:10:16,680 --> 00:10:21,160
<font color="#00ff00">All functions of the Punishment Dome</font>
<font color="#00ff00">are recorded as warnings to</font>
<font color="#00ff00">miscreants everywhere.</font>

156
00:10:21,160 --> 00:10:25,680
<font color="#00ffff">But they entertain</font>
<font color="#00ffff">as well as instruct?</font>

157
00:10:25,680 --> 00:10:27,680
<font color="#00ff00">You must ask my Chief Officer,</font>

158
00:10:27,680 --> 00:10:30,680
<font color="#00ff00">he's responsible for</font>
<font color="#00ff00">COMTEC Division product.</font>

159
00:10:30,680 --> 00:10:35,520
<font color="#00ffff">I would hope to help organise</font>
<font color="#00ffff">your sales exports...</font>

160
00:10:36,800 --> 00:10:41,840
<font color="#00ffff">..if you consent to</font>
<font color="#00ffff">lower your Zeiton price!</font>

161
00:10:41,840 --> 00:10:43,320
<font color="#00ff00">I can't, sorry.</font>

162
00:10:43,320 --> 00:10:46,280
<font color="#00ffff">Then my patience is exhausted.</font>

163
00:10:46,280 --> 00:10:48,600
<font color="#00ffff">And spent totally!</font>

164
00:10:48,600 --> 00:10:52,840
<font color="#ffff00">The people are anxious for a</font>
<font color="#ffff00">decision on the new price of our</font>
<font color="#ffff00">product.</font>

165
00:10:52,840 --> 00:10:57,000
<font color="#00ff00">Negotiations between</font>
<font color="#00ff00">ourselves and Galatron Mining are</font>
<font color="#00ff00">far from complete.</font>

166
00:10:57,000 --> 00:10:59,520
<font color="#00ff00">The broadcast must be delayed.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Impossible.</font>

167
00:10:59,520 --> 00:11:02,520
<font color="#ffff00">Rules must be obeyed</font>
<font color="#ffff00">by Governors as well as prisoners.</font>

168
00:11:02,520 --> 00:11:04,520
<font color="#00ff00">What is the difference?</font>

169
00:11:04,520 --> 00:11:07,160
<font color="#ffff00">What point have you reached,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">gentlemen?</font>

170
00:11:07,160 --> 00:11:11,560
<font color="#00ffff">STALEMATE!</font>
<font color="#00ffff">On contracts, royalties, everything!</font>

171
00:11:13,760 --> 00:11:18,240
<font color="#ffff00">Surely,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">a little movement regarding cost?</font>

172
00:11:18,240 --> 00:11:22,360
<font color="#00ffff">Already I have gone beyond my</font>
<font color="#00ffff">authority</font>

173
00:11:22,360 --> 00:11:26,280
<font color="#00ffff">to meet the stubbornness</font>
<font color="#00ffff">of this Governor.</font>

174
00:11:26,280 --> 00:11:29,560
<font color="#00ff00">We must have an</font>
<font color="#00ff00">increase of price, we must!</font>

175
00:11:29,560 --> 00:11:32,240
<font color="#00ffff">I will wait.</font>

176
00:11:32,240 --> 00:11:34,720
<font color="#00ffff">Perhaps the next Governor...</font>

177
00:11:36,400 --> 00:11:39,200
<font color="#00ffff">..will be more sensible of reality.</font>

178
00:11:39,200 --> 00:11:41,760
<font color="#00ff00">I am the Governor, you deal with me.</font>

179
00:11:42,960 --> 00:11:46,720
<font color="#00ffff">But tonight, you must place yourself</font>

180
00:11:46,720 --> 00:11:50,600
<font color="#00ffff">at the mercy of the votes</font>
<font color="#00ffff">of your people.</font>

181
00:11:50,600 --> 00:11:55,120
<font color="#00ffff">Should they not agree</font>
<font color="#00ffff">with your stubborn stance,</font>

182
00:11:55,120 --> 00:11:59,360
<font color="#00ffff">you may be obliterated!</font>

183
00:11:59,360 --> 00:12:01,960
<font color="#ffffff">LAUGHS EVILLY</font>

184
00:12:04,760 --> 00:12:07,520
<font color="#ffffff">DOWNWARD HUM</font>

185
00:12:07,520 --> 00:12:09,400
<font color="#ffffff">That's interesting,</font>

186
00:12:09,400 --> 00:12:11,800
<font color="#ffffff">not to say arresting!</font>

187
00:12:11,800 --> 00:12:15,200
<font color="#ffff00">Where are we?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Neither here nor there.</font>

188
00:12:15,200 --> 00:12:17,960
<font color="#ffff00">Doctor?</font><font color="#ffffff"> Somewhere!</font>

189
00:12:17,960 --> 00:12:19,120
<font color="#ffffff">Let's see!</font>

190
00:12:21,680 --> 00:12:25,080
<font color="#ffffff">Stalled! In the equivalent</font>
<font color="#ffffff">of a galactic lay-by!</font>

191
00:12:25,080 --> 00:12:27,600
<font color="#ffffff">See?</font><font color="#ffff00"> No.</font>

192
00:12:27,600 --> 00:12:29,800
<font color="#ffffff">Mid-way between Cetes and Sculptor!</font>

193
00:12:29,800 --> 00:12:34,120
<font color="#ffffff">Materialised into actual</font>
<font color="#ffffff">and temporal void.</font>

194
00:12:37,760 --> 00:12:39,360
<font color="#ffff00">Yes, but why won't it move?</font>

195
00:12:41,800 --> 00:12:44,880
<font color="#ffffff">This is the one problem</font>
<font color="#ffffff">a TARDIS cannot overcome.</font>

196
00:12:44,880 --> 00:12:48,600
<font color="#ffffff">Like all things in the universe,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">she cannot move without power...</font>

197
00:12:50,640 --> 00:12:52,040
<font color="#ffffff">..and energy.</font>

198
00:12:54,760 --> 00:12:58,360
<font color="#ffff00">Yes, Doctor, but we can!</font>

199
00:12:58,360 --> 00:13:00,120
<font color="#ffff00">Don't give up, please!</font>

200
00:13:00,120 --> 00:13:03,680
<font color="#ffffff">It's all right for you, Peri.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Me? Why's it OK for me?</font>

201
00:13:03,680 --> 00:13:05,640
<font color="#ffffff">You've only got one life.</font>

202
00:13:05,640 --> 00:13:08,400
<font color="#ffffff">You'll age here in</font>
<font color="#ffffff">the TARDIS and die!</font>

203
00:13:08,400 --> 00:13:10,400
<font color="#ffffff">Me...</font>

204
00:13:10,400 --> 00:13:15,160
<font color="#ffffff">I shall go on regenerating</font>
<font color="#ffffff">until all my lives are spent.</font>

205
00:13:15,160 --> 00:13:18,240
<font color="#00ffff">Like this Governor we do not.</font>

206
00:13:18,240 --> 00:13:20,960
<font color="#00ffff">Replace you must arrange most soon.</font>

207
00:13:20,960 --> 00:13:25,440
<font color="#00ffff">That is what our secret</font>
<font color="#00ffff">payments to you are for.</font>

208
00:13:26,560 --> 00:13:31,240
<font color="#00ff00">My dear Sil, a little patience</font>
<font color="#00ff00">is all that is required. Trust me!</font>

209
00:13:32,360 --> 00:13:35,200
<font color="#00ffff">Do you think he suspects</font>
<font color="#00ffff">the truth of matters?</font>

210
00:13:35,200 --> 00:13:38,000
<font color="#00ff00">He simply wants a better deal!</font>

211
00:13:38,000 --> 00:13:42,200
<font color="#00ffff">Maybe I should dispense</font>
<font color="#00ffff">with your pay-offs.</font>

212
00:13:42,200 --> 00:13:46,120
<font color="#00ffff">Perhaps I should offer</font>
<font color="#00ffff">that and you to him?</font>

213
00:13:46,120 --> 00:13:48,760
<font color="#00ff00">You simply really</font>
<font color="#00ff00">mustn't threaten me.</font>

214
00:13:50,040 --> 00:13:52,720
<font color="#00ff00">You need me for what</font>
<font color="#00ff00">you hope to gain here.</font>

215
00:13:52,720 --> 00:13:55,560
<font color="#00ffff">If I do not succeed one way,</font>

216
00:13:55,560 --> 00:13:57,600
<font color="#00ffff">I favour another.</font>

217
00:14:00,520 --> 00:14:02,280
<font color="#00ffff">Enough talk!</font>

218
00:14:02,280 --> 00:14:09,320
<font color="#00ffff">I would wish to witness the</font>
<font color="#00ffff">suffering moments of this fool</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Governorship.</font>

219
00:14:11,120 --> 00:14:12,680
<font color="#ffffff">HE COUGHS LIGHTLY</font>

220
00:14:19,560 --> 00:14:23,720
<font color="#00ff00">Good evening. For centuries,</font>
<font color="#00ff00">the Galatron Mining Corporation</font>

221
00:14:23,720 --> 00:14:26,840
<font color="#00ff00">has declared rich dividends</font>
<font color="#00ff00">by exploiting our labour.</font>

222
00:14:26,840 --> 00:14:29,680
<font color="#00ff00">Now is the time</font>
<font color="#00ff00">to steel ourselves for sacrifice</font>

223
00:14:29,680 --> 00:14:32,680
<font color="#00ff00">to gain what is ours by right.</font>

224
00:14:32,680 --> 00:14:37,160
<font color="#00ff00">As always, I seek ways to market</font>
<font color="#00ff00">the resources of our poor planet...</font>

225
00:14:37,160 --> 00:14:40,720
<font color="#00ffff">Blah, blah, blah! Get to the</font>
<font color="#00ffff">point!</font><font color="#ffff00"> Shut your mouth!</font>

226
00:14:40,720 --> 00:14:42,840
<font color="#00ff00">..I ask seven credits per unit...</font>

227
00:14:42,840 --> 00:14:46,000
<font color="#00ffff">You won't get it!</font>
<font color="#ffff00">One more yak out of you,</font>

228
00:14:46,000 --> 00:14:48,960
<font color="#ffff00">and you're in my report</font>
<font color="#ffff00">as a subvert!</font>

229
00:14:48,960 --> 00:14:52,320
<font color="#00ffff">I'm entitled to an opinion!</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Entitled to a vote is all!</font>

230
00:14:52,320 --> 00:14:54,280
<font color="#00ffff">I know how I'll use that!</font>

231
00:14:54,280 --> 00:14:59,280
<font color="#00ff00">Viewers of Varos, I ask that we</font>
<font color="#00ff00">agree to hold out for a fair price</font>

232
00:14:59,280 --> 00:15:03,200
<font color="#00ff00">for our principal marketable</font>
<font color="#00ff00">resource, that of Zeiton ore.</font>

233
00:15:03,200 --> 00:15:07,080
<font color="#00ff00">Those who wish to fight alongside</font>
<font color="#00ff00">me for a prosperous tomorrow,</font>

234
00:15:07,080 --> 00:15:11,600
<font color="#00ff00">vote "yes" to a 10%</font>
<font color="#00ff00">reduction of our food rations.</font>

235
00:15:11,600 --> 00:15:16,920
<font color="#00ff00">Those who wish for full bellies</font>
<font color="#00ff00">today and nothing to eat tomorrow</font>

236
00:15:16,920 --> 00:15:20,400
<font color="#00ff00">have the option to punch their</font>
<font color="#00ff00">"no" button.</font>

237
00:15:20,400 --> 00:15:21,760
<font color="#00ffff">Right!</font>

238
00:15:50,280 --> 00:15:52,640
<font color="#ffffff">WARPING HUM</font>

239
00:15:55,520 --> 00:15:57,320
<font color="#ffffff">HE GROANS</font>

240
00:16:03,440 --> 00:16:05,640
<font color="#ffffff">HE GROANS</font>

241
00:16:13,560 --> 00:16:16,880
<font color="#00ffff">He's lost! Go on, pour it on and on!</font>

242
00:16:16,880 --> 00:16:20,280
<font color="#00ffff">Yes, he's going!</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Yes, he's snuffed it!</font><font color="#ffff00"> Has he?</font>

243
00:16:21,520 --> 00:16:23,480
<font color="#ffffff">WARPING HUM STOPS</font>

244
00:16:23,480 --> 00:16:25,160
<font color="#ffffff">HE GROANS</font>

245
00:16:28,080 --> 00:16:30,400
<font color="#00ffff">Next time, next time for sure.</font>

246
00:16:30,400 --> 00:16:35,280
<font color="#ffff00">He's strong!</font>
<font color="#ffff00">That's three losing votes in a row!</font>

247
00:16:35,280 --> 00:16:38,240
<font color="#00ffff">Yeah, next vote'll</font>
<font color="#00ffff">see him blasted out for sure.</font>

248
00:16:38,240 --> 00:16:41,440
<font color="#00ffff">No-one's taken four bashings</font>
<font color="#00ffff">from that cell disintegrator!</font>

249
00:16:41,440 --> 00:16:42,680
<font color="#ffff00">I wish you'd leave him alone!</font>

250
00:16:42,680 --> 00:16:43,800
<font color="#00ffff">Why?</font>

251
00:16:43,800 --> 00:16:46,440
<font color="#00ffff">He's the worst Governor since...</font>

252
00:16:46,440 --> 00:16:49,240
<font color="#00ffff">..well, since...</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Since the last one!</font>

253
00:16:53,240 --> 00:16:55,200
<font color="#00ff00">Is the Governor no more?</font>

254
00:16:55,200 --> 00:16:57,880
<font color="#ffff00">He survived...just.</font>

255
00:16:57,880 --> 00:17:02,400
<font color="#00ff00">We must arrange good riddance</font>
<font color="#00ff00">of this bad Governor soon!</font>

256
00:17:02,400 --> 00:17:06,360
<font color="#00ffff">He is weakened by the human cell</font>
<font color="#00ffff">disintegration bombardment.</font>

257
00:17:06,360 --> 00:17:10,800
<font color="#00ffff">Engage him in negotiations now</font>
<font color="#00ffff">and you may gain advantage.</font>

258
00:17:16,800 --> 00:17:19,640
<font color="#ffffff">Permission to leave Governor's</font>
<font color="#ffffff">domain.</font>

259
00:17:25,640 --> 00:17:29,200
<font color="#00ffff">Congratulations, sir,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">you survived the vote.</font>

260
00:17:31,240 --> 00:17:34,720
<font color="#00ff00">Soon, your death will be apparent.</font>

261
00:17:36,680 --> 00:17:38,520
<font color="#00ff00">You will see.</font>

262
00:17:39,920 --> 00:17:42,880
<font color="#00ff00">Should we try again to reach</font>
<font color="#00ff00">agreement</font>

263
00:17:42,880 --> 00:17:47,520
<font color="#00ff00">before I must communicate</font>
<font color="#00ff00">with my executive council?</font>

264
00:17:47,520 --> 00:17:49,160
<font color="#ffffff">Later.</font>

265
00:17:49,160 --> 00:17:51,560
<font color="#00ff00">Now or never!</font>

266
00:17:54,240 --> 00:17:57,000
<font color="#ffffff">Give me a moment or two.</font>

267
00:17:57,000 --> 00:17:58,400
<font color="#00ff00">Very well!</font>

268
00:17:59,400 --> 00:18:01,920
<font color="#00ff00">Transport me to the office</font>
<font color="#00ff00">of the Governor!</font>

269
00:18:04,960 --> 00:18:09,080
<font color="#00ff00">I find the G-forces of this</font>
<font color="#00ff00">Varos-sized world quite excessive.</font>

270
00:18:11,000 --> 00:18:12,520
<font color="#ffffff">I'm so tired!</font>

271
00:18:13,680 --> 00:18:17,480
<font color="#00ffff">I warned the people would not accept</font>
<font color="#00ffff">yet more rationing cuts,</font>

272
00:18:17,480 --> 00:18:19,320
<font color="#00ffff">whatever the reason.</font>

273
00:18:19,320 --> 00:18:24,200
<font color="#ffffff">This system of referendum...</font>
<font color="#ffffff">How much longer can I survive?</font>

274
00:18:24,200 --> 00:18:26,160
<font color="#00ffff">One more vote?</font>

275
00:18:26,160 --> 00:18:30,400
<font color="#ffff00">Governor? May I suggest</font>
<font color="#ffff00">you do something to please,</font>

276
00:18:30,400 --> 00:18:33,840
<font color="#ffff00">to entertain, to please the people?</font>

277
00:18:34,920 --> 00:18:37,800
<font color="#ffff00">Just to give yourself time</font>
<font color="#ffff00">to recover your strength.</font>

278
00:18:37,800 --> 00:18:41,000
<font color="#ffff00">Why not give them the life</font>
<font color="#ffff00">of the rebel Jondar?</font>

279
00:18:41,000 --> 00:18:43,560
<font color="#ffff00">After all,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">it's his death or yours!</font>

280
00:18:43,560 --> 00:18:46,000
<font color="#ffffff">It would have to be something</font>
<font color="#ffffff">different.</font>

281
00:18:46,000 --> 00:18:49,040
<font color="#ffff00">I thought perhaps by laser</font>
<font color="#ffff00">obliteration, sir,</font>

282
00:18:49,040 --> 00:18:52,080
<font color="#ffff00">by a concentrated build-up of power.</font>

283
00:18:52,080 --> 00:18:54,160
<font color="#ffff00">Neutralise the "Q" switch.</font>

284
00:18:54,160 --> 00:18:57,840
<font color="#ffff00">That way the random laser emitter</font>
<font color="#ffff00">builds up to a giant pulse of light,</font>

285
00:18:57,840 --> 00:19:00,480
<font color="#ffff00">an explosion of focused laser energy</font>

286
00:19:00,480 --> 00:19:02,800
<font color="#ffff00">that will wipe the prisoner</font>
<font color="#ffff00">out of existence.</font>

287
00:19:04,920 --> 00:19:07,160
<font color="#ffffff">We have never shown</font>
<font color="#ffffff">that style of dispatch.</font>

288
00:19:07,160 --> 00:19:09,760
<font color="#00ffff">Too quick,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">it would be over too soon.</font>

289
00:19:09,760 --> 00:19:13,400
<font color="#00ffff">We'd never sell so swift an</font>
<font color="#00ffff">execution.</font><font color="#ffff00"> It's the uncertainty!</font>

290
00:19:13,400 --> 00:19:16,680
<font color="#ffff00">No-one knows quite when</font>
<font color="#ffff00">the power will blow!</font>

291
00:19:16,680 --> 00:19:20,800
<font color="#ffff00">We'd get at least ten minutes of</font>
<font color="#ffff00">tension out of his apprehension and</font>
<font color="#ffff00">fear.</font>

292
00:19:20,800 --> 00:19:23,120
<font color="#00ffff">It's novel, I suppose.</font>

293
00:19:23,120 --> 00:19:26,400
<font color="#ffff00">I'm sure the video of</font>
<font color="#ffff00">his execution would sell.</font>

294
00:19:26,400 --> 00:19:28,760
<font color="#ffff00">You said we must export or die.</font>

295
00:19:30,120 --> 00:19:32,720
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, yes, I did.</font>

296
00:19:34,240 --> 00:19:36,880
<font color="#ffffff">Very well, arrange it.</font>

297
00:19:36,880 --> 00:19:38,520
<font color="#ffffff">And, Bax...</font>

298
00:19:38,520 --> 00:19:39,840
<font color="#ffff00">Sir?</font>

299
00:19:39,840 --> 00:19:41,720
<font color="#ffffff">Thank you for the suggestion.</font>

300
00:19:47,520 --> 00:19:49,840
<font color="#ffff00">End random pulses. Conserve CB.</font>

301
00:19:49,840 --> 00:19:52,000
<font color="#ffff00">Neutralise "Q" switch.</font>

302
00:19:52,000 --> 00:19:54,760
<font color="#ffff00">Activate viewing of</font>
<font color="#ffff00">imminent public execution.</font>

303
00:19:57,560 --> 00:19:59,600
<font color="#ffffff">DOCTOR SIGHS</font>

304
00:19:59,600 --> 00:20:03,600
<font color="#ffff00">Here, a little something to stop you</font>
<font color="#ffff00">sighing like a steam engine!</font>

305
00:20:03,600 --> 00:20:06,120
<font color="#ffffff">What is it?</font><font color="#ffff00"> TARDIS manual.</font>

306
00:20:06,120 --> 00:20:09,240
<font color="#ffff00">I found it in the</font>
<font color="#ffff00">workshop propping open a vent.</font>

307
00:20:09,240 --> 00:20:11,080
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, yeah!</font>

308
00:20:11,080 --> 00:20:12,920
<font color="#ffffff">Started reading that once.</font>

309
00:20:14,120 --> 00:20:15,760
<font color="#ffff00">Hey!</font>

310
00:20:16,920 --> 00:20:19,240
<font color="#ffff00">Won't it tell you what's</font>
<font color="#ffff00">wrong with the TARDIS?</font>

311
00:20:19,240 --> 00:20:23,680
<font color="#ffffff">I know perfectly well what category</font>
<font color="#ffffff">of disaster has befallen us.</font>

312
00:20:23,680 --> 00:20:25,080
<font color="#ffff00">The comparator?</font>

313
00:20:27,160 --> 00:20:28,760
<font color="#ffffff">No. No, not this time.</font>

314
00:20:31,120 --> 00:20:33,920
<font color="#ffffff">HE SIGHS</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Might as well confirm my diagnosis.</font>

315
00:20:35,480 --> 00:20:38,080
<font color="#ffffff">Something to pass eternity with,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">I suppose.</font>

316
00:20:50,880 --> 00:20:53,080
<font color="#ffff00">Doctor, the column moved!</font>

317
00:20:53,080 --> 00:20:54,560
<font color="#ffffff">Oh?</font>

318
00:20:54,560 --> 00:20:58,560
<font color="#ffffff">Probably some vestigial power</font>
<font color="#ffffff">passing through to the transitional</font>
<font color="#ffffff">elements.</font>

319
00:21:00,360 --> 00:21:01,400
<font color="#ffffff">Which would mean...</font>

320
00:21:03,880 --> 00:21:06,320
<font color="#ffffff">Where are we?</font><font color="#ffff00"> What is it?</font>

321
00:21:07,560 --> 00:21:09,880
<font color="#ffffff">Yes. Hold that!</font>

322
00:21:09,880 --> 00:21:13,840
<font color="#ffffff">Don't lose the place,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">and don't give up hope! Not yet!</font>

323
00:21:13,840 --> 00:21:15,520
<font color="#ffff00">Yes, Doctor.</font>

324
00:21:16,600 --> 00:21:21,640
<font color="#00ffff">Another attempt will be made to</font>
<font color="#00ffff">obtain better terms for the mining</font>
<font color="#00ffff">of our resources.</font>

325
00:21:23,080 --> 00:21:24,440
<font color="#00ffff">One other pronouncement.</font>

326
00:21:25,520 --> 00:21:30,120
<font color="#00ffff">As Governor, I hold</font>
<font color="#00ffff">final say as to the appeal against</font>
<font color="#00ffff">sentence of death.</font>

327
00:21:30,120 --> 00:21:34,520
<font color="#00ffff">The rebel Jondar, although enduring</font>
<font color="#00ffff">his pre-execution ordeal well,</font>

328
00:21:34,520 --> 00:21:39,400
<font color="#00ffff">must nevertheless suffer the fate of</font>
<font color="#00ffff">all who transgress the rules</font>

329
00:21:39,400 --> 00:21:40,800
<font color="#00ffff">of our society.</font>

330
00:21:41,960 --> 00:21:45,360
<font color="#00ffff">At eight o'clock, then,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">attend to your screens</font>

331
00:21:45,360 --> 00:21:48,320
<font color="#00ffff">to witness what must befall all</font>

332
00:21:48,320 --> 00:21:50,880
<font color="#00ffff">who oppose the reality</font>

333
00:21:50,880 --> 00:21:54,360
<font color="#00ffff">of our just constitution.</font>

334
00:22:06,280 --> 00:22:09,360
<font color="#ffff00">The order for your husband's</font>
<font color="#ffff00">execution has just been received.</font>

335
00:22:09,360 --> 00:22:12,200
<font color="#00ffff">When is it?</font>

336
00:22:12,200 --> 00:22:13,720
<font color="#ffff00">Soon.</font>

337
00:22:13,720 --> 00:22:17,280
<font color="#00ffff">Jondar was your friend!</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Before he rebelled against orders.</font>

338
00:22:17,280 --> 00:22:19,720
<font color="#00ffff">Curious how being a guard has</font>
<font color="#00ffff">changed you!</font>

339
00:22:19,720 --> 00:22:22,200
<font color="#ffff00">I can do nothing!</font><font color="#00ffff"> Rondel!</font>

340
00:22:22,200 --> 00:22:26,880
<font color="#ffff00">Do you know what he found?</font>
<font color="#ffff00">What he saw?</font><font color="#00ffff"> No, please!</font>

341
00:22:26,880 --> 00:22:29,600
<font color="#ffff00">While the rest of us</font>
<font color="#ffff00">toil without hope,</font>

342
00:22:29,600 --> 00:22:32,760
<font color="#ffff00">the officer elite enjoy</font>
<font color="#ffff00">power and luxury.</font>

343
00:22:32,760 --> 00:22:36,040
<font color="#00ffff">Lies!</font><font color="#ffff00"> Varos is what it always was,</font>

344
00:22:36,040 --> 00:22:37,840
<font color="#ffff00">a prison planet,</font>

345
00:22:37,840 --> 00:22:40,440
<font color="#ffff00">a colony for the criminally insane!</font>

346
00:22:40,440 --> 00:22:45,280
<font color="#ffff00">The descendants of the original</font>
<font color="#ffff00">officers still rule...by fear!</font>

347
00:22:45,280 --> 00:22:48,800
<font color="#ffff00">With the spectacle of death</font>
<font color="#ffff00">our only entertainment.</font>

348
00:22:50,080 --> 00:22:53,720
<font color="#ffff00">That is what Jondar found,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">what he learned.</font>

349
00:22:53,720 --> 00:22:56,200
<font color="#ffff00">That is why they want to kill him.</font>

350
00:22:56,200 --> 00:22:57,520
<font color="#00ffff">I must leave!</font>

351
00:22:57,520 --> 00:22:59,480
<font color="#ffff00">Can't we make an attempt</font>
<font color="#ffff00">to save him?</font>

352
00:23:00,880 --> 00:23:03,040
<font color="#ffff00">Rondel, please!</font>

353
00:23:03,040 --> 00:23:04,440
<font color="#00ffff">It's too late!</font>

354
00:23:08,280 --> 00:23:10,240
<font color="#ffffff">TR reading from the IV table?</font>

355
00:23:10,240 --> 00:23:13,520
<font color="#ffff00">Is that in the hyper-time</font>
<font color="#ffff00">ratio section?</font><font color="#ffffff"> Where else?</font>

356
00:23:13,520 --> 00:23:18,680
<font color="#ffff00">Um, orthoganal reading is</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Zee S plus 101 EQ.</font>

357
00:23:18,680 --> 00:23:22,040
<font color="#ffffff">"Zee"? "Zed"!</font>

358
00:23:22,040 --> 00:23:23,760
<font color="#ffff00">Yes.</font>

359
00:23:23,760 --> 00:23:24,960
<font color="#ffffff">That's as it should be!</font>

360
00:23:24,960 --> 00:23:27,160
<font color="#ffffff">The power converter</font>
<font color="#ffffff">factor seems stable,</font>

361
00:23:27,160 --> 00:23:30,320
<font color="#ffffff">so why aren't we receiving</font>
<font color="#ffffff">full transmission of that power?</font>

362
00:23:30,320 --> 00:23:32,720
<font color="#ffffff">There's a possibility! May I?</font>

363
00:23:32,720 --> 00:23:34,400
<font color="#ffff00">What is it?</font>

364
00:23:34,400 --> 00:23:36,320
<font color="#ffffff">Let me see.</font>

365
00:23:36,320 --> 00:23:38,280
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, we might...</font>

366
00:23:38,280 --> 00:23:39,520
<font color="#ffffff">We'll try!</font>

367
00:23:39,520 --> 00:23:40,760
<font color="#ffffff">Hold that!</font>

368
00:23:43,440 --> 00:23:45,800
<font color="#ffffff">CONTROLS HUM</font>

369
00:23:48,520 --> 00:23:50,760
<font color="#ffffff">HUMMING INTENSIFIES</font>

370
00:23:50,760 --> 00:23:52,480
<font color="#ffff00">Doctor, it's working!</font>

371
00:23:52,480 --> 00:23:55,440
<font color="#ffffff">With the last vestiges</font>
<font color="#ffffff">of our emergency power booster.</font>

372
00:23:55,440 --> 00:23:57,840
<font color="#ffffff">Enough for a limited flight,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">no further!</font>

373
00:23:57,840 --> 00:24:00,600
<font color="#ffffff">What depresses me most</font>
<font color="#ffffff">is that the transitional elements</font>

374
00:24:00,600 --> 00:24:04,520
<font color="#ffffff">have lost their capacity to generate</font>
<font color="#ffffff">orbital energy and must be replaced!</font>

375
00:24:04,520 --> 00:24:07,320
<font color="#ffff00">How long would that take?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">No time at all.</font>

376
00:24:07,320 --> 00:24:11,400
<font color="#ffffff">If we obtain enough Zeiton-7 to</font>
<font color="#ffffff">reline the trans-power system, the</font>
<font color="#ffffff">TARDIS should be...</font>

377
00:24:11,400 --> 00:24:14,320
<font color="#ffffff">Well, as she was.</font>

378
00:24:14,320 --> 00:24:16,160
<font color="#ffffff">It's not the fitting that's the</font>
<font color="#ffffff">problem.</font>

379
00:24:16,160 --> 00:24:18,720
<font color="#ffffff">Zeiton is a very rare element.</font>

380
00:24:18,720 --> 00:24:21,760
<font color="#ffffff">It's only found on one planet.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Let's go there, then!</font>

381
00:24:22,960 --> 00:24:24,600
<font color="#ffffff">Mm?</font>

382
00:24:24,600 --> 00:24:29,080
<font color="#ffffff">I suppose if we use the emergency</font>
<font color="#ffffff">power booster to bypass the failing</font>
<font color="#ffffff">circuits,</font>

383
00:24:29,080 --> 00:24:33,320
<font color="#ffffff">we could just reach the planet Varos</font>
<font color="#ffffff">in the constellation of Cetes.</font>

384
00:24:33,320 --> 00:24:35,560
<font color="#ffffff">Question is, when?</font>

385
00:24:35,560 --> 00:24:38,960
<font color="#ffffff">If we missed their mining era,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">we'd be stranded for evermore!</font>

386
00:24:38,960 --> 00:24:41,360
<font color="#ffff00">Anything's better than</font>
<font color="#ffff00">being stuck here!</font>

387
00:24:48,160 --> 00:24:50,720
<font color="#00ffff">What's inside that skull?</font>

388
00:24:53,840 --> 00:24:57,040
<font color="#00ffff">Anger? Fear?</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Hatred of you, Quillam!</font>

389
00:24:57,040 --> 00:24:59,920
<font color="#00ffff">Ah, but hatred of yourself as well!</font>

390
00:24:59,920 --> 00:25:05,600
<font color="#00ffff">We all have some parts of</font>
<font color="#00ffff">our mind that we consider unworthy,</font>

391
00:25:05,600 --> 00:25:08,880
<font color="#00ffff">some memory that makes us shudder</font>

392
00:25:08,880 --> 00:25:10,720
<font color="#00ffff">and squirm.</font>

393
00:25:12,800 --> 00:25:16,760
<font color="#00ffff">Do you know what my process</font>
<font color="#00ffff">of transmutation does?</font>

394
00:25:16,760 --> 00:25:22,280
<font color="#00ffff">It focuses on the</font>
<font color="#00ffff">seeds of fear in your mind</font>

395
00:25:22,280 --> 00:25:24,720
<font color="#00ffff">and makes them grow,</font>

396
00:25:24,720 --> 00:25:30,440
<font color="#00ffff">until you, your body,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">your face, your entire being</font>

397
00:25:30,440 --> 00:25:33,680
<font color="#00ffff">transforms into the image</font>
<font color="#00ffff">in your mind.</font>

398
00:25:36,080 --> 00:25:39,040
<font color="#00ffff">You should turn into</font>
<font color="#00ffff">something quite interesting.</font>

399
00:25:39,040 --> 00:25:40,560
<font color="#00ffff">A reptile!</font>

400
00:25:41,840 --> 00:25:44,040
<font color="#00ffff">Or something simian perhaps!</font>

401
00:25:44,040 --> 00:25:47,720
<font color="#ffff00">Or something truly loathsome,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">such as you!</font>

402
00:25:51,640 --> 00:25:54,280
<font color="#ffff00">Take her to the rehabilitation unit!</font>

403
00:25:54,280 --> 00:25:55,760
<font color="#00ff00">Sir!</font>

404
00:26:02,280 --> 00:26:07,600
<font color="#ffff00">For sedition, thought rebellion and</font>
<font color="#ffff00">incitement of other rebels to</font>
<font color="#ffff00">organise,</font>

405
00:26:07,600 --> 00:26:11,880
<font color="#ffff00">to unionise and to terrorise</font>
<font color="#ffff00">the workforce of Varos,</font>

406
00:26:11,880 --> 00:26:17,560
<font color="#ffff00">the vote of the people was for</font>
<font color="#ffff00">your death to take place by laser</font>
<font color="#ffff00">obliteration.</font>

407
00:26:17,560 --> 00:26:20,680
<font color="#00ffff">The Governor was to consider</font>
<font color="#00ffff">my appeal!</font>

408
00:26:20,680 --> 00:26:23,520
<font color="#ffff00">Our Governor bows to the</font>
<font color="#ffff00">will of his people.</font>

409
00:26:23,520 --> 00:26:25,880
<font color="#ffff00">As Systems Arbiter</font>
<font color="#ffff00">and Chief Officer,</font>

410
00:26:25,880 --> 00:26:30,120
<font color="#ffff00">I confirm that the conditions</font>
<font color="#ffff00">of the constitution</font>
<font color="#ffff00">have been complied with.</font>

411
00:26:30,120 --> 00:26:33,480
<font color="#ffff00">I therefore permit</font>
<font color="#ffff00">your execution to proceed.</font>

412
00:26:33,480 --> 00:26:36,400
<font color="#00ffff">When will this be, Chief Officer?</font>

413
00:26:36,400 --> 00:26:38,320
<font color="#ffff00">At eight o'clock.</font>

414
00:26:38,320 --> 00:26:42,040
<font color="#ffff00">You will have ample time</font>
<font color="#ffff00">to compose yourself for eternity.</font>

415
00:26:42,040 --> 00:26:44,520
<font color="#ffff00">All of five short minutes!</font>

416
00:26:47,600 --> 00:26:50,360
<font color="#ffff00">It isn't exactly certain</font>
<font color="#ffff00">when obliteration takes place.</font>

417
00:26:50,360 --> 00:26:52,280
<font color="#ffff00">Stand clear of the execution site.</font>

418
00:26:52,280 --> 00:26:54,760
<font color="#ffff00">You have</font>
<font color="#ffff00">your anti-hallucination helmet?</font>

419
00:26:54,760 --> 00:26:56,440
<font color="#00ff00">Yes, sir.</font><font color="#ffff00"> Good. Switched on?</font>

420
00:26:56,440 --> 00:26:59,160
<font color="#00ff00">Yes, sir!</font><font color="#ffff00"> Good, we wouldn't wish</font>
<font color="#ffff00">for my guards</font>

421
00:26:59,160 --> 00:27:01,480
<font color="#ffff00">to succumb to the phantoms</font>
<font color="#ffff00">of the Punishment Dome.</font>

422
00:27:01,480 --> 00:27:04,520
<font color="#ffff00">Not with all of Varos watching.</font>
<font color="#00ff00">No, sir.</font>

423
00:27:17,600 --> 00:27:19,760
<font color="#ffffff">MACHINE HUMS</font>

424
00:27:22,000 --> 00:27:24,400
<font color="#ffffff">METALLIC THRUMMING</font>

425
00:27:35,840 --> 00:27:38,080
<font color="#ffffff">Ah! Who's this coming to welcome us?</font>

426
00:27:45,760 --> 00:27:47,120
<font color="#ffffff">Hmm.</font>

427
00:27:51,600 --> 00:27:54,520
<font color="#00ff00">Control? Senior Guard Maldak 239.</font>

428
00:27:54,520 --> 00:27:57,240
<font color="#00ff00">Report of fault on</font>
<font color="#00ff00">anti-hallucination helmet.</font>

429
00:27:57,240 --> 00:28:01,360
<font color="#00ff00">Am experiencing sensory distortion.</font>
<font color="#00ff00">Permission to withdraw?</font>

430
00:28:01,360 --> 00:28:04,320
<font color="#00ffff">Stay until after execution.</font>

431
00:28:04,320 --> 00:28:05,960
<font color="#00ff00">Understood.</font>

432
00:28:07,880 --> 00:28:12,480
<font color="#ffff00">Artificial atmosphere, enclosed,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">underground, breathable.</font>

433
00:28:12,480 --> 00:28:15,320
<font color="#ffffff">But distorted readings</font>
<font color="#ffffff">from a nearby power source.</font>

434
00:28:15,320 --> 00:28:17,800
<font color="#ffff00">What kind of place is this, Doctor?</font>

435
00:28:17,800 --> 00:28:22,160
<font color="#ffff00">Why did that man fire at us and then</font>
<font color="#ffff00">turn away as if we didn't exist?</font>

436
00:28:22,160 --> 00:28:23,680
<font color="#ffffff">Let's go and ask him!</font>

437
00:28:42,280 --> 00:28:45,400
<font color="#ffff00">Sir, Chief, something's wrong!</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Be quiet! Attend your function!</font>

438
00:28:45,400 --> 00:28:47,360
<font color="#ffff00">But...</font><font color="#00ff00"> SILENCE!</font>

439
00:28:47,360 --> 00:28:50,680
<font color="#00ff00">Execution is imminent!</font>

440
00:28:53,680 --> 00:28:55,760
<font color="#ffffff">SIL WARBLES EXCITEDLY</font>

441
00:29:00,040 --> 00:29:02,200
<font color="#ffffff">What is it?</font>

442
00:29:02,200 --> 00:29:07,520
<font color="#00ff00">This is the most wonderful</font>
<font color="#00ff00">entertainment.</font>

443
00:29:20,080 --> 00:29:21,640
<font color="#ffffff">Hello!</font><font color="#ffff00"> Hi!</font>

444
00:29:21,640 --> 00:29:24,720
<font color="#ffffff">Not interrupting anything?</font>
<font color="#00ffff">I know how this place works!</font>

445
00:29:24,720 --> 00:29:27,360
<font color="#00ffff">You are a product of my mind.</font>

446
00:29:27,360 --> 00:29:30,400
<font color="#00ffff">I will resist you to</font>
<font color="#00ffff">know you cannot exist.</font>

447
00:29:30,400 --> 00:29:31,640
<font color="#ffffff">Quite right!</font>

448
00:29:31,640 --> 00:29:33,840
<font color="#00ffff">Control, my helmet's</font>
<font color="#00ffff">malfunctioning!</font>

449
00:29:33,840 --> 00:29:36,760
<font color="#00ffff">Permission to withdraw!</font>
<font color="#ffffff">That's what we've come to fix, eh?</font>

450
00:29:36,760 --> 00:29:39,000
<font color="#ffff00">Sure!</font><font color="#ffffff"> Let me have it!</font>

451
00:29:39,000 --> 00:29:41,160
<font color="#ffffff">Come on, give it to me NOW!</font>

452
00:29:41,160 --> 00:29:44,040
<font color="#ffff00">Doctor! Careful!</font>

453
00:29:49,760 --> 00:29:51,040
<font color="#ffffff">Thank you!</font>

454
00:29:52,400 --> 00:29:56,440
<font color="#00ff00">Is this planned?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Certainly not. What's happened?</font>

455
00:29:56,440 --> 00:29:58,880
<font color="#00ffff">I'll alert the IR Squad immediately,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">sir.</font>

456
00:29:58,880 --> 00:30:01,280
<font color="#ffff00">There's another group...</font>
<font color="#00ffff">We have seen!</font>

457
00:30:01,280 --> 00:30:03,640
<font color="#ffffff">Are they rebels?</font><font color="#ffff00"> I don't know.</font>

458
00:30:07,800 --> 00:30:11,320
<font color="#ffffff">We must...we must act!</font>

459
00:30:11,320 --> 00:30:16,720
<font color="#00ff00">They must be apprehended,</font>
<font color="#00ff00">sentenced, executed, ALL OF THEM!</font>

460
00:30:16,720 --> 00:30:19,480
<font color="#ffffff">Attend to it!</font><font color="#00ffff"> Sir!</font>

461
00:30:19,480 --> 00:30:21,520
<font color="#00ffff">Bax!</font><font color="#ffff00"> Sir.</font>

462
00:30:21,520 --> 00:30:27,640
<font color="#00ff00">My company is only interested</font>
<font color="#00ff00">in stable situations.</font>

463
00:30:27,640 --> 00:30:30,200
<font color="#ffffff">Varos has been stable for</font>
<font color="#ffffff">more than 200 years.</font>

464
00:30:30,200 --> 00:30:32,160
<font color="#00ff00">See you remain so!</font>

465
00:30:32,160 --> 00:30:37,200
<font color="#00ff00">Or a most unfavourable</font>
<font color="#00ff00">report I will give!</font>

466
00:30:37,200 --> 00:30:40,160
<font color="#ffffff">I'm... I... I...</font>

467
00:30:42,680 --> 00:30:44,240
<font color="#00ff00">Help him!</font>

468
00:30:47,960 --> 00:30:51,560
<font color="#00ff00">Now, my dear friend,</font>

469
00:30:51,560 --> 00:30:57,400
<font color="#00ff00">what is good price for</font>
<font color="#00ff00">your Zeiton-7 ore?</font>

470
00:30:57,400 --> 00:30:59,560
<font color="#ffffff">Seven credits per unit...</font>

471
00:31:02,800 --> 00:31:04,440
<font color="#ffffff">I'm so, so tired...</font>

472
00:31:04,440 --> 00:31:06,480
<font color="#ffffff">SIL WARBLES</font>

473
00:31:06,480 --> 00:31:09,320
<font color="#00ff00">Seven credits a unit?</font>

474
00:31:09,320 --> 00:31:13,560
<font color="#00ff00">When the engineers</font>
<font color="#00ff00">of every known solar system</font>

475
00:31:13,560 --> 00:31:16,120
<font color="#00ff00">cry out for his product</font>

476
00:31:16,120 --> 00:31:19,560
<font color="#00ff00">to drive their space-time craft?</font>

477
00:31:19,560 --> 00:31:24,120
<font color="#00ff00">A planet of fools who</font>
<font color="#00ff00">don't realise their luck</font>

478
00:31:24,120 --> 00:31:26,240
<font color="#00ff00">and don't deserve to!</font>

479
00:31:27,520 --> 00:31:29,200
<font color="#00ff00">Return to our craft!</font>

480
00:31:29,200 --> 00:31:32,880
<font color="#00ff00">Alert the Council to have</font>
<font color="#00ff00">a colonising force sent here.</font>

481
00:31:32,880 --> 00:31:34,520
<font color="#ffff00">Right!</font>

482
00:31:37,000 --> 00:31:39,600
<font color="#00ff00">When I control this planet,</font>

483
00:31:39,600 --> 00:31:43,600
<font color="#00ff00">I will possess the means of power</font>

484
00:31:43,600 --> 00:31:47,520
<font color="#00ff00">throughout this entire galaxy!</font>

485
00:31:50,360 --> 00:31:55,520
<font color="#00ff00">And perhaps</font>
<font color="#00ff00">for all others beyond!</font>

486
00:31:57,000 --> 00:32:01,560
<font color="#00ffff">Help me, whoever you are! Quickly!</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Pull him away from the wall!</font>

487
00:32:03,040 --> 00:32:05,360
<font color="#ffff00">Like this?</font><font color="#ffffff"> That's it!</font>

488
00:32:05,360 --> 00:32:09,120
<font color="#ffffff">Right, hold!</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Close your eyes and wish for luck!</font>

489
00:32:09,120 --> 00:32:11,640
<font color="#ffffff">Here we go!</font>

490
00:32:14,160 --> 00:32:15,920
<font color="#ffffff">Now the other one!</font>

491
00:32:27,280 --> 00:32:29,680
<font color="#00ffff">Who are you?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">I'll explain in the TARDIS.</font>

492
00:32:29,680 --> 00:32:30,880
<font color="#ffff00">Doctor!</font>

493
00:32:30,880 --> 00:32:33,600
<font color="#ffffff">To retreat another way</font>
<font color="#ffffff">might be more viable!</font>

494
00:32:33,600 --> 00:32:36,840
<font color="#ffff00">They're too close!</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Help me turn this round.</font>

495
00:32:41,840 --> 00:32:43,400
<font color="#ffffff">Come on!</font>

496
00:32:49,840 --> 00:32:51,840
<font color="#00ff00">Argh!</font>

497
00:32:52,920 --> 00:32:55,160
<font color="#00ffff">Kill laser connection!</font>

498
00:33:12,040 --> 00:33:14,160
<font color="#00ffff">Run, run, go on, run!</font>

499
00:33:16,440 --> 00:33:18,360
<font color="#ffffff">It's a dead end!</font>

500
00:33:18,360 --> 00:33:20,920
<font color="#00ffff">I can't go on!</font><font color="#ffff00"> Nor me!</font>

501
00:33:20,920 --> 00:33:22,960
<font color="#ffffff">What is this place?</font>

502
00:33:22,960 --> 00:33:25,120
<font color="#00ffff">An ordinary prison once, but...</font>

503
00:33:26,680 --> 00:33:28,440
<font color="#00ffff">There's a patrol car coming.</font>

504
00:33:28,440 --> 00:33:31,160
<font color="#00ffff">I thought there was</font>
<font color="#00ffff">an escape cell here.</font>

505
00:33:31,160 --> 00:33:33,640
<font color="#ffffff">Let's create some difficulty</font>
<font color="#ffffff">for our uniformed friends!</font>

506
00:33:33,640 --> 00:33:35,000
<font color="#00ffff">Why help me?</font>

507
00:33:35,000 --> 00:33:37,880
<font color="#ffffff">You're the only one</font>
<font color="#ffffff">who hasn't attacked us!</font>

508
00:33:37,880 --> 00:33:39,920
<font color="#ffffff">Help me, pull! PULL!</font>

509
00:33:41,440 --> 00:33:43,720
<font color="#ffffff">Right, see what I can do with this!</font>

510
00:33:43,720 --> 00:33:45,040
<font color="#ffffff">Stand back!</font>

511
00:33:51,000 --> 00:33:53,320
<font color="#ffffff">MONITOR CRACKLES</font>

512
00:33:53,320 --> 00:33:55,080
<font color="#00ffff">Where's that emergency lighting?</font>

513
00:34:03,720 --> 00:34:05,120
<font color="#ffffff">If you insist!</font>

514
00:34:07,640 --> 00:34:09,280
<font color="#ffff00">This way!</font>

515
00:34:32,720 --> 00:34:34,120
<font color="#00ff00">I thought we'd lost you!</font>

516
00:34:34,120 --> 00:34:37,600
<font color="#00ff00">They arranged your execution so</font>
<font color="#00ff00">quickly, we couldn't attempt a</font>
<font color="#00ff00">rescue.</font>

517
00:34:37,600 --> 00:34:40,360
<font color="#00ffff">You didn't send him?</font><font color="#00ff00"> No.</font>

518
00:34:40,360 --> 00:34:44,760
<font color="#ffffff">I'll explain, but I'd rather get</font>
<font color="#ffffff">back to the safety of the TARDIS,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">er...ship!</font>

519
00:34:44,760 --> 00:34:47,280
<font color="#00ffff">Spaceship?</font><font color="#ffff00"> Something like that!</font>

520
00:34:47,280 --> 00:34:50,640
<font color="#00ff00">We'll escape through the guards'</font>
<font color="#00ff00">entrance.</font><font color="#ffff00"> We must leave!</font>

521
00:34:50,640 --> 00:34:53,120
<font color="#ffffff">First, what is this place?</font>

522
00:34:53,120 --> 00:34:55,520
<font color="#00ffff">This place is where the</font>
<font color="#00ffff">innocent are tortured,</font>

523
00:34:55,520 --> 00:34:58,520
<font color="#00ffff">while the population gloats</font>
<font color="#00ffff">at our efforts to survive!</font>

524
00:34:58,520 --> 00:35:01,160
<font color="#ffff00">Not all enjoy, some seek to help.</font>

525
00:35:01,160 --> 00:35:03,760
<font color="#00ff00">For every Rondel, there are a</font>
<font color="#00ff00">thousand Varosians</font>

526
00:35:03,760 --> 00:35:07,800
<font color="#00ff00">slumped before screens, deadened by</font>
<font color="#00ff00">overwork and starvation.</font><font color="#ffffff"> Starvation?</font>

527
00:35:07,800 --> 00:35:10,960
<font color="#ffffff">Varos has precious minerals!</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Zeiton-7!</font>

528
00:35:10,960 --> 00:35:13,520
<font color="#00ffff">That stuff! Who wants it?</font>

529
00:35:13,520 --> 00:35:16,560
<font color="#ffffff">I wouldn't say no to a little!</font>
<font color="#ffff00">We must go!</font>

530
