00:49:49,280 --> 00:49:53,000
<font color="#ffff00">Sil's language transposer has an</font>
<font color="#ffff00">eccentric communication circuit.</font>

706
00:49:53,000 --> 00:49:56,880
<font color="#ffff00">But don't tell him,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">it's my only amusement.</font>

707
00:49:56,880 --> 00:50:00,240
<font color="#00ff00">Don't upset the Galatron delegate,</font>
<font color="#00ff00">please.</font>

708
00:50:00,240 --> 00:50:03,760
<font color="#00ff00">We need that agreement to sell the</font>
<font color="#00ff00">Zeiton ore to his company.</font>

709
00:50:03,760 --> 00:50:08,280
<font color="#ffff00">On the starvation rate he offers us?</font>
<font color="#00ff00">Who else will buy our only asset?</font>

710
00:50:08,280 --> 00:50:10,400
<font color="#ffff00">Why not find other mining companies</font>

711
00:50:10,400 --> 00:50:12,960
<font color="#ffff00">who will refine Zeiton ore</font>
<font color="#ffff00">on better terms?</font>

712
00:50:12,960 --> 00:50:16,760
<font color="#ffff00">Who will pay the seven credits</font>
<font color="#ffff00">per unit I ask? Why not Amorb?</font>

713
00:50:16,760 --> 00:50:20,880
<font color="#00ffff">NEVER!</font><font color="#00ff00"> The people of Varos have</font>
<font color="#00ff00">voted to accept Sil's final terms.</font>

714
00:50:20,880 --> 00:50:24,160
<font color="#00ff00">You, as Governor, must impose their</font>
<font color="#00ff00">will or suffer death by default.</font>

715
00:50:24,160 --> 00:50:29,640
<font color="#ffff00">After I extract the truth about this</font>
<font color="#ffff00">girl and her companion, the Doctor.</font>

716
00:50:38,920 --> 00:50:40,240
<font color="#ffff00">Come.</font>

717
00:51:03,000 --> 00:51:05,480
<font color="#ffffff">I had the most peculiar...</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Argh!</font><font color="#ffffff"> ..dream!</font>

718
00:51:19,760 --> 00:51:21,400
<font color="#ffffff">GUARD SCREAMS</font>

719
00:51:33,680 --> 00:51:35,680
<font color="#ffffff">You'll forgive me</font>
<font color="#ffffff">if I don't join you.</font>

720
00:51:39,200 --> 00:51:41,480
<font color="#ffff00">What's the matter?</font>

721
00:51:41,480 --> 00:51:45,080
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, you grieve for his death.</font>

722
00:51:45,080 --> 00:51:47,040
<font color="#ffff00">I forget that people do.</font>

723
00:51:47,040 --> 00:51:49,200
<font color="#00ff00">You don't?</font>

724
00:51:49,200 --> 00:51:51,480
<font color="#ffff00">I did once.</font>

725
00:51:51,480 --> 00:51:53,800
<font color="#ffff00">But now death is my only friend...</font>

726
00:51:55,400 --> 00:51:58,000
<font color="#ffff00">..my constant and loving companion.</font>

727
00:51:59,560 --> 00:52:03,960
<font color="#ffff00">Can you feel his...his</font>
<font color="#ffff00">cold presence?</font>

728
00:52:03,960 --> 00:52:06,320
<font color="#00ff00">I don't want to, thanks!</font>

729
00:52:06,320 --> 00:52:09,840
<font color="#ffff00">You should. Your life</font>
<font color="#ffff00">is even more at risk than mine.</font>

730
00:52:12,600 --> 00:52:15,800
<font color="#00ffff">The Doctor, he's escaped!</font>

731
00:52:15,800 --> 00:52:19,680
<font color="#ffff00">How? He's dead.</font><font color="#00ffff"> Not dead, he was</font>
<font color="#00ffff">just pretending to be.</font>

732
00:52:19,680 --> 00:52:22,200
<font color="#00ff00">He's alive?</font><font color="#00ffff"> And running.</font>

733
00:52:22,200 --> 00:52:23,760
<font color="#ffff00">Good.</font><font color="#00ffff"> Good?</font>

734
00:52:23,760 --> 00:52:27,640
<font color="#ffff00">Recapture him and we bargain this</font>
<font color="#ffff00">girl's life for information</font>

735
00:52:27,640 --> 00:52:29,200
<font color="#ffff00">from our Doctor friend.</font>

736
00:52:29,200 --> 00:52:33,320
<font color="#00ff00">And I thought you were a bit better</font>
<font color="#00ff00">than these other brutes!</font>

737
00:52:33,320 --> 00:52:35,440
<font color="#ffff00">I'm sorry.</font>

738
00:52:56,840 --> 00:52:59,120
<font color="#ffffff">I thought you were my mirror image,</font>

739
00:52:59,120 --> 00:53:02,560
<font color="#ffffff">until I realised that</font>
<font color="#ffffff">I wasn't holding a...gun?</font>

740
00:53:02,560 --> 00:53:05,920
<font color="#ffff00">Who are you?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">A student of science!</font>

741
00:53:05,920 --> 00:53:08,960
<font color="#ffffff">Much interested in primitive</font>
<font color="#ffffff">nuclear technology.</font>

742
00:53:08,960 --> 00:53:11,440
<font color="#ffff00">The mask, remove it!</font>

743
00:53:14,840 --> 00:53:17,480
<font color="#ffff00">I've seen you on the screens!</font>

744
00:53:17,480 --> 00:53:20,280
<font color="#ffff00">You've returned from the dead.</font>

745
00:53:20,280 --> 00:53:22,160
<font color="#ffffff">A waste of effort.</font>

746
00:53:22,160 --> 00:53:25,440
<font color="#ffffff">I assume there will be something</font>
<font color="#ffffff">novel by way of spectacle</font>

747
00:53:25,440 --> 00:53:28,000
<font color="#ffffff">to mark my return to that state?</font>

748
00:53:28,000 --> 00:53:31,200
<font color="#ffff00">I should think something might</font>
<font color="#ffff00">be arranged.</font>

749
00:53:31,200 --> 00:53:33,800
<font color="#ffff00">Let's have a little word with the</font>
<font color="#ffff00">executioners.</font>

750
00:53:33,800 --> 00:53:36,440
<font color="#ffff00">They're always on the lookout</font>
<font color="#ffff00">for fresh material.</font>

751
00:53:39,280 --> 00:53:42,160
<font color="#ffffff">After you.</font><font color="#ffff00"> I don't think so.</font>

752
00:53:49,560 --> 00:53:52,240
<font color="#00ff00">Why is she on Varos?</font>

753
00:53:52,240 --> 00:53:54,400
<font color="#ffff00">She won't say.</font>

754
00:53:54,400 --> 00:53:58,640
<font color="#00ff00">Are you employed agent</font>
<font color="#00ff00">of other mining companies?</font>

755
00:53:58,640 --> 00:54:01,720
<font color="#00ff00">You and that man who was dead?</font>

756
00:54:01,720 --> 00:54:03,880
<font color="#00ffff">No.</font><font color="#00ff00"> LIAR!</font>

757
00:54:03,880 --> 00:54:07,520
<font color="#00ff00">You belong to Amorb! You lying liar!</font>

758
00:54:07,520 --> 00:54:10,320
<font color="#ffff00">Why should she belong to Amorb?</font>

759
00:54:10,320 --> 00:54:12,000
<font color="#ffff00">Well?</font>

760
00:54:13,160 --> 00:54:17,160
<font color="#00ffff">I'm from another time,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">another century.</font>

761
00:54:18,320 --> 00:54:22,120
<font color="#00ffff">Nearly three centuries before you</font>
<font color="#00ffff">were born, I lived in another world.</font>

762
00:54:23,680 --> 00:54:27,600
<font color="#00ffff">I had an idea you wouldn't</font>
<font color="#00ffff">believe me.</font><font color="#ffff00"> You were right.</font>

763
00:54:30,640 --> 00:54:33,600
<font color="#00ffff">Give her to the rehabilitators.</font>

764
00:54:33,600 --> 00:54:37,120
<font color="#00ffff">A disturbance of her molecular</font>
<font color="#00ffff">structure will bring out the truth.</font>

765
00:54:37,120 --> 00:54:40,640
<font color="#00ff00">Put her into the</font>
<font color="#00ff00">reshapement chamber.</font>

766
00:54:40,640 --> 00:54:45,560
<font color="#00ff00">Watch her change into beast or bird.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">SIL LAUGHS</font>

767
00:54:45,560 --> 00:54:47,240
<font color="#00ffff">No!</font>

768
00:54:49,800 --> 00:54:52,240
<font color="#ffff00">Why are you here, Peri?</font>

769
00:54:52,240 --> 00:54:53,480
<font color="#ffff00">Tell me, please.</font>

770
00:54:56,040 --> 00:54:57,560
<font color="#00ffff">All right.</font>

771
00:54:57,560 --> 00:55:01,640
<font color="#00ffff">Our TARDIS, that box-thing outside,</font>

772
00:55:01,640 --> 00:55:06,520
<font color="#00ffff">is, if you like, a ship of time,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">a sort of spacecraft.</font>

773
00:55:08,560 --> 00:55:11,120
<font color="#00ffff">Well, I don't understand the</font>
<font color="#00ffff">technical stuff,</font>

774
00:55:11,120 --> 00:55:15,800
<font color="#00ffff">but the Doctor said we must have</font>
<font color="#00ffff">this special metal,</font>

775
00:55:15,800 --> 00:55:17,920
<font color="#00ffff">to fix the bearings or something.</font>

776
00:55:17,920 --> 00:55:20,600
<font color="#00ffff">So we had to come here.</font>

777
00:55:20,600 --> 00:55:24,600
<font color="#00ffff">That's just what we did!</font><font color="#00ff00"> She's</font>
<font color="#00ff00">laughing at us, all over the face!</font>

778
00:55:24,600 --> 00:55:27,480
<font color="#00ffff">It's the truth!</font><font color="#ffff00"> No matter!</font>

779
00:55:27,480 --> 00:55:30,360
<font color="#00ffff">Once again, we've captured the</font>
<font color="#00ffff">mysterious Doctor.</font>

780
00:55:30,360 --> 00:55:32,400
<font color="#ffff00">Quillam came across him</font>
<font color="#ffff00">at Prison Control.</font>

781
00:55:32,400 --> 00:55:36,120
<font color="#00ffff">He'd have liked that, sir.</font><font color="#ffff00"> Yes.</font>

782
00:55:36,120 --> 00:55:39,600
<font color="#ffff00">How long is it since we rigged</font>
<font color="#ffff00">a primitive execution, Chief?</font>

783
00:55:39,600 --> 00:55:43,000
<font color="#00ffff">Not since after the Outer Dome</font>
<font color="#00ffff">sabotage trial.</font>

784
00:55:47,720 --> 00:55:50,840
<font color="#ffff00">I think it's time we staged another.</font>

785
00:55:50,840 --> 00:55:53,160
<font color="#00ffff">They're always most enjoyable,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">aren't they, sir?</font>

786
00:55:53,160 --> 00:55:55,200
<font color="#ffffff">SIL GUFFAWS</font>

787
00:55:55,200 --> 00:55:57,960
<font color="#00ff00">What kind of people are you?</font>

788
00:55:57,960 --> 00:56:00,880
<font color="#ffffff">THEY GROWL</font>

789
00:56:09,520 --> 00:56:10,960
<font color="#ffffff">Oh!</font>

790
00:56:18,160 --> 00:56:19,840
<font color="#ffffff">What are you doing?</font>

791
00:56:19,840 --> 00:56:21,480
<font color="#ffff00">My viewer's report.</font>

792
00:56:23,400 --> 00:56:25,560
<font color="#ffffff">I'm not on it, am I?</font>

793
00:56:25,560 --> 00:56:26,760
<font color="#ffffff">I was tired.</font>

794
00:56:30,240 --> 00:56:33,960
<font color="#ffffff">Reports, spying. Working men</font>
<font color="#ffffff">should be...</font>

795
00:56:33,960 --> 00:56:36,080
<font color="#ffff00">Yes?</font>

796
00:56:36,080 --> 00:56:38,960
<font color="#ffff00">Yes? Go on.</font>

797
00:56:39,960 --> 00:56:42,440
<font color="#ffffff">Erm, not taken seriously</font>
<font color="#ffffff">for the rubbish</font>

798
00:56:42,440 --> 00:56:44,440
<font color="#ffffff">they may have spoken earlier on.</font>

799
00:56:56,000 --> 00:57:00,160
<font color="#ffffff">Hello!</font><font color="#ffff00"> Your appeal has been turned</font>
<font color="#ffff00">down. I'm sorry.</font>

800
00:57:01,400 --> 00:57:04,960
<font color="#ffffff">So would I have been,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">if I'd asked for one.</font>

801
00:57:08,640 --> 00:57:10,800
<font color="#ffffff">Do you always get the priest parts?</font>

802
00:57:10,800 --> 00:57:14,640
<font color="#00ffff"># We are gathered here today</font>
<font color="#00ffff">in the sight of the great Video</font>

803
00:57:14,640 --> 00:57:17,680
<font color="#00ffff"># To ask forgiveness</font>
<font color="#00ffff">and make atonement</font>

804
00:57:17,680 --> 00:57:21,680
<font color="#00ffff"># For three amongst us who have</font>
<font color="#00ffff">transgressed the laws of Varos. #</font>

805
00:57:24,080 --> 00:57:27,360
<font color="#ffff00">Doctor, I-I...I'm sorry!</font>
<font color="#ffff00">I've tried everything.</font>

806
00:57:27,360 --> 00:57:29,560
<font color="#ffff00">They just won't believe the truth.</font>

807
00:57:29,560 --> 00:57:34,040
<font color="#ffffff">Truth is a very flexible commodity</font>
<font color="#ffffff">here on Varos, Peri.</font>

808
00:57:34,040 --> 00:57:38,200
<font color="#ffffff">As long as things APPEAR truthful,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">that's all that matters.</font>

809
00:57:38,200 --> 00:57:43,520
<font color="#00ffff">Enlighten us as to the truth</font>
<font color="#00ffff">about your visit, please, Doctor.</font>

810
00:57:43,520 --> 00:57:48,760
<font color="#ffffff">Why, to help Varos realise the</font>
<font color="#ffffff">wealth of its potential, what else?</font>

811
00:57:48,760 --> 00:57:54,080
<font color="#00ff00">How, by eating rocks?</font>

812
00:57:48,760 --> 00:57:54,080
<font color="#ffffff">HE LAUGHS</font>

813
00:57:54,080 --> 00:57:57,040
<font color="#00ff00">Kill him! Execute them!</font>

814
00:57:57,040 --> 00:58:00,880
<font color="#ffff00">He must have listened to the rebel</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Jondar, believed his lies.</font>

815
00:58:00,880 --> 00:58:05,560
<font color="#00ffff">Yes, yes. What is the staging plan,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Chief?</font>

816
00:58:05,560 --> 00:58:10,080
<font color="#ffff00">The men to hang. The women, I would</font>
<font color="#ffff00">suggest, be given to reshapement</font>

817
00:58:10,080 --> 00:58:11,720
<font color="#ffff00">and cell mutation experiment.</font>

818
00:58:11,720 --> 00:58:14,400
<font color="#ffff00">The results to be exhibited</font>
<font color="#ffff00">as a warning to women</font>

819
00:58:14,400 --> 00:58:16,480
<font color="#ffff00">who support their men</font>
<font color="#ffff00">in acts of violation</font>

820
00:58:16,480 --> 00:58:18,960
<font color="#ffff00">against the regulations of Varos.</font>

821
00:58:18,960 --> 00:58:22,480
<font color="#ffff00">I'm sorry you'll be denied the sight</font>
<font color="#ffff00">of the ladies turning into...</font>

822
00:58:22,480 --> 00:58:24,000
<font color="#ffff00">Well, who knows what?</font>

823
00:58:24,000 --> 00:58:27,920
<font color="#ffff00">A serpent? A griffin?</font>
<font color="#ffff00">A new admixture of fish and fowl?</font>

824
00:58:32,320 --> 00:58:33,960
<font color="#00ffff">Anything to add, Doctor?</font>

825
00:58:33,960 --> 00:58:37,320
<font color="#00ffff">Anything which might persuade me to</font>
<font color="#00ffff">halt the sequence of events?</font>

826
00:58:38,600 --> 00:58:41,480
<font color="#ffffff">One request.</font><font color="#ffff00"> One last request?</font>

827
00:58:41,480 --> 00:58:44,400
<font color="#ffff00">Yes?</font><font color="#00ffff"> Well?</font>

828
00:58:44,400 --> 00:58:47,440
<font color="#ffffff">Who is he? Why is he here?</font>

829
00:58:47,440 --> 00:58:50,400
<font color="#00ff00">What interest can my presence</font>
<font color="#00ff00">matter?</font>

830
00:58:50,400 --> 00:58:53,000
<font color="#00ffff">The delegate from the Galatron</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Mining Corporation</font>

831
00:58:53,000 --> 00:58:54,080
<font color="#00ffff">is here to negotiate</font>

832
00:58:54,080 --> 00:58:58,240
<font color="#00ffff">our yearly review of market price</font>
<font color="#00ffff">for the ore of Varos.</font>

833
00:58:59,320 --> 00:59:02,800
<font color="#ffffff">Zeiton ore? Zeiton-7?</font><font color="#00ffff"> Yes.</font>

834
00:59:02,800 --> 00:59:05,840
<font color="#ffffff">I see. Thank you.</font>

835
00:59:05,840 --> 00:59:08,160
<font color="#00ffff">Is that all you wish to know?</font>

836
00:59:08,160 --> 00:59:09,560
<font color="#ffffff">For the moment.</font>

837
00:59:09,560 --> 00:59:13,200
<font color="#00ff00">That's all you have, Doctor!</font>

838
00:59:13,200 --> 00:59:15,040
<font color="#ffff00">Take the women away.</font>

839
00:59:15,040 --> 00:59:17,200
<font color="#ffff00">No! Doctor, do something!</font>

840
00:59:17,200 --> 00:59:19,200
<font color="#ffffff">Jondar! Jondar!</font>

841
00:59:21,160 --> 00:59:23,920
<font color="#00ffff"># In the name of the great Video</font>

842
00:59:23,920 --> 00:59:28,800
<font color="#00ffff"># And of Varos</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Who gave his name to our planet</font>

843
00:59:28,800 --> 00:59:32,040
<font color="#00ffff"># Accept the lives</font>
<font color="#00ffff">of these humble deviants</font>

844
00:59:32,040 --> 00:59:35,080
<font color="#00ffff"># In the recompense for their sins</font>

845
00:59:35,080 --> 00:59:38,080
<font color="#00ffff"># We pray that you will continue</font>
<font color="#00ffff">to look</font>

846
00:59:38,080 --> 00:59:43,280
<font color="#00ffff"># Benignly down upon</font>
<font color="#00ffff">your devoted servants. #</font>

847
00:59:47,400 --> 00:59:49,600
<font color="#00ffff">Anything to say, Doctor?</font>

848
00:59:49,600 --> 00:59:52,160
<font color="#00ffff">Anything which may yet</font>
<font color="#00ffff">save your lives?</font>

849
00:59:52,160 --> 00:59:55,520
<font color="#ffffff">Sorry?</font>

850
00:59:55,520 --> 00:59:58,360
<font color="#00ffff">So am I. All right.</font>

851
00:59:58,360 --> 01:00:00,560
<font color="#ffffff">Wait!</font>

852
01:00:00,560 --> 01:00:04,960
<font color="#00ffff">I knew it! Hold on broadcast.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">No sound or vision.</font>

853
01:00:04,960 --> 01:00:08,960
<font color="#ffffff">My death will prevent Varos</font>
<font color="#ffffff">from ever progressing</font>

854
01:00:08,960 --> 01:00:13,880
<font color="#ffffff">out of the reach of extortion of</font>
<font color="#ffffff">such as the Galatron Mining Company.</font>

855
01:00:13,880 --> 01:00:16,440
<font color="#ffffff">Our deaths will send any hope for</font>
<font color="#ffffff">this planet</font>

856
01:00:16,440 --> 01:00:18,560
<font color="#ffffff">back into the pit of fear</font>
<font color="#ffffff">and misery,</font>

857
01:00:18,560 --> 01:00:21,560
<font color="#ffffff">which has, for so long, been the lot</font>
<font color="#ffffff">of its people.</font>

858
01:00:21,560 --> 01:00:26,600
<font color="#00ff00">Pull the lever! Stretch them out of</font>
<font color="#00ff00">this life!</font><font color="#ffffff"> Wait!</font>

859
01:00:26,600 --> 01:00:29,880
<font color="#ffffff">I came to this planet because</font>
<font color="#ffffff">I needed a new source</font>

860
01:00:29,880 --> 01:00:35,320
<font color="#ffffff">of energy supply.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">My TARDIS depends for its function</font>

861
01:00:35,320 --> 01:00:39,200
<font color="#ffffff">upon a rare and precious mineral</font>
<font color="#ffffff">of Varos.</font>

862
01:00:39,200 --> 01:00:42,000
<font color="#ffffff">Zeiton-7.</font>

863
01:00:42,000 --> 01:00:44,800
<font color="#ffffff">I can show you new prosperity!</font>

864
01:00:44,800 --> 01:00:47,200
<font color="#00ff00">DESTROY THEM NOW!</font>

865
01:00:47,200 --> 01:00:50,040
<font color="#00ffff">I will give the order for execution!</font>

866
01:00:50,040 --> 01:00:52,480
<font color="#00ff00">KILL! KILL! KILL! Oh!</font>

867
01:01:20,360 --> 01:01:23,280
<font color="#00ffff">I trust you are unharmed, Doctor?</font>

868
01:01:23,280 --> 01:01:26,400
<font color="#ffffff">Do you often employ the noose trick?</font>

869
01:01:26,400 --> 01:01:28,800
<font color="#00ffff">As a means of eliciting true</font>
<font color="#00ffff">information,</font>

870
01:01:28,800 --> 01:01:30,560
<font color="#00ffff">it has often been successful.</font>

871
01:01:30,560 --> 01:01:34,880
<font color="#00ffff">You suspected our bluff?</font><font color="#ffffff"> I noticed</font>
<font color="#ffffff">your cameras weren't broadcasting.</font>

872
01:01:34,880 --> 01:01:38,680
<font color="#ffffff">A real execution would have been</font>
<font color="#ffffff">broadcast.</font>

873
01:01:38,680 --> 01:01:40,720
<font color="#00ffff">Ah, yes...</font>

874
01:01:40,720 --> 01:01:43,960
<font color="#00ffff">What I have to discover now is</font>
<font color="#00ffff">the truth of your statements</font>

875
01:01:43,960 --> 01:01:45,360
<font color="#00ffff">made from the scaffold.</font>

876
01:01:45,360 --> 01:01:48,040
<font color="#ffffff">I will discuss nothing,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">reveal nothing,</font>

877
01:01:48,040 --> 01:01:53,160
<font color="#ffffff">until I have proof that Peri and</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Areta have been released unharmed</font>

878
01:01:53,160 --> 01:01:55,920
<font color="#ffffff">from the cell mutation experiment.</font>

879
01:01:55,920 --> 01:01:59,240
<font color="#00ff00">He has nothing to reveal,</font>
<font color="#00ff00">he is lying!</font>

880
01:01:59,240 --> 01:02:02,720
<font color="#00ff00">An Amorb agent who wishes</font>
<font color="#00ff00">only to usurp</font>

881
01:02:02,720 --> 01:02:07,840
<font color="#00ff00">our worthy Galatron contracts</font>
<font color="#00ff00">by rashful promises!</font>

882
01:02:07,840 --> 01:02:10,960
<font color="#00ffff">Until I can hear what each of you</font>
<font color="#00ffff">has to say or offer,</font>

883
01:02:10,960 --> 01:02:13,280
<font color="#00ffff">the matter rests without decision.</font>

884
01:02:13,280 --> 01:02:15,680
<font color="#00ffff">Should the Doctor be lying, he will</font>
<font color="#00ffff">find the next noose</font>

885
01:02:15,680 --> 01:02:18,320
<font color="#00ffff">about his neck will sever his head</font>
<font color="#00ffff">from his spinal column.</font>

886
01:02:18,320 --> 01:02:22,240
<font color="#00ffff">But should he be accurate in his</font>
<font color="#00ffff">appraisal of the potential worth</font>

887
01:02:22,240 --> 01:02:27,920
<font color="#00ffff">of our Zeiton ore, I shall want to</font>
<font color="#00ffff">know, Sil, why you and your company</font>

888
01:02:27,920 --> 01:02:30,720
<font color="#00ffff">have been duping Varos</font>
<font color="#00ffff">these many generations.</font>

889
01:02:30,720 --> 01:02:34,120
<font color="#00ff00">How dare I be spoken to like this!</font>

890
01:02:34,120 --> 01:02:36,600
<font color="#00ff00">I will reject all offers!</font>

891
01:02:36,600 --> 01:02:40,680
<font color="#00ffff">That releases me from my people's</font>
<font color="#00ffff">decision to accept them, thank you!</font>

892
01:02:40,680 --> 01:02:42,480
<font color="#00ff00">BLAST!</font>

893
01:02:42,480 --> 01:02:45,560
<font color="#ffff00">How long will the process last?</font>

894
01:02:45,560 --> 01:02:49,080
<font color="#00ffff">I heard them say it was a matter for</font>
<font color="#00ffff">initial experiment.</font>

895
01:02:49,080 --> 01:02:52,800
<font color="#ffff00">Anything could happen to us</font>
<font color="#ffff00">just for their amusement.</font>

896
01:02:52,800 --> 01:02:57,600
<font color="#00ffff">My arms! Something's happening to</font>
<font color="#00ffff">my arms!</font>

897
01:02:57,600 --> 01:03:00,880
<font color="#ffff00">M-M-Mine feel strange, too.</font>

898
01:03:00,880 --> 01:03:02,400
<font color="#ffff00">My skin...</font>

899
01:03:05,760 --> 01:03:06,960
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, no!</font>

900
01:03:09,800 --> 01:03:13,360
<font color="#00ff00">Intolerable all of this Doctor</font>
<font color="#00ff00">being allowed to live!</font>

901
01:03:13,360 --> 01:03:16,080
<font color="#ffff00">The Governor likes and</font>
<font color="#ffff00">may believe him!</font>

902
01:03:16,080 --> 01:03:19,880
<font color="#ffff00">Zeiton-7 has brought</font>
<font color="#ffff00">your company great wealth.</font>

903
01:03:19,880 --> 01:03:22,320
<font color="#ffff00">You have miscalculated events.</font>

904
01:03:22,320 --> 01:03:24,880
<font color="#ffff00">For the sake of a few miserable</font>
<font color="#ffff00">extra credits,</font>

905
01:03:24,880 --> 01:03:28,160
<font color="#ffff00">you may have lost the source</font>
<font color="#ffff00">of all our wealth and power!</font>

906
01:03:28,160 --> 01:03:33,920
<font color="#00ff00">Listen to me! I have plans to take</font>
<font color="#00ff00">charge of this planet of Varos.</font>

907
01:03:33,920 --> 01:03:38,080
<font color="#00ff00">I have put in a request to have a</font>
<font color="#00ff00">Galatron occupation force</font>

908
01:03:38,080 --> 01:03:39,880
<font color="#00ff00">to speed to this sector.</font>

909
01:03:39,880 --> 01:03:43,760
<font color="#00ff00">A little time is all we need, Chief.</font>

910
01:03:43,760 --> 01:03:47,600
<font color="#ffff00">The Doctor will tell him the true</font>
<font color="#ffff00">value of Zeiton!</font>

911
01:03:47,600 --> 01:03:51,720
<font color="#00ff00">Only if his women are</font>
<font color="#00ff00">released unharmed.</font>

912
01:03:51,720 --> 01:03:54,480
<font color="#00ff00">Have you done that?</font>

913
01:03:54,480 --> 01:03:56,120
<font color="#ffff00">Not yet.</font>

914
01:03:56,120 --> 01:03:58,120
<font color="#00ff00">Then...</font>

915
01:03:58,120 --> 01:04:05,840
<font color="#00ff00">..let us observe the experiment</font>
<font color="#00ff00">of the tissue transmogrifier.</font>

916
01:04:05,840 --> 01:04:10,680
<font color="#00ff00">I am interested in science.</font>

917
01:04:10,680 --> 01:04:14,800
<font color="#00ff00">I do not wish to impede</font>
<font color="#00ff00">its progress.</font>

918
01:04:34,600 --> 01:04:39,880
<font color="#00ff00">There. Doctor's friend is feathered.</font>

919
01:04:41,520 --> 01:04:46,600
<font color="#00ff00">The other one, she's almost</font>
<font color="#00ff00">attractive now.</font>

920
01:04:48,560 --> 01:04:53,160
<font color="#00ff00">How long before permanent</font>
<font color="#00ff00">result ensues?</font>

921
01:04:53,160 --> 01:04:58,240
<font color="#ffff00">I'm not exactly certain. It's not</font>
<font color="#ffff00">too long, I would think.</font>

922
01:04:58,240 --> 01:05:03,080
<font color="#00ff00">Perhaps I'll keep them in my Dome</font>

923
01:05:03,080 --> 01:05:08,200
<font color="#00ff00">as pretty, pretty pets!</font>

924
01:05:14,760 --> 01:05:19,040
<font color="#00ffff">It is too advanced!</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Well, where are they?</font>

925
01:05:20,000 --> 01:05:21,600
<font color="#ffff00">There's a problem.</font><font color="#ffffff"> What?</font>

926
01:05:21,600 --> 01:05:23,680
<font color="#ffff00">Something they call a</font>
<font color="#ffff00">"transmogrifier"</font>

927
01:05:23,680 --> 01:05:25,160
<font color="#ffff00">was at too advanced a stage.</font>

928
01:05:25,160 --> 01:05:29,080
<font color="#00ffff">We were unable to reverse the</font>
<font color="#00ffff">transmutation of your lovely ladies.</font>

929
01:05:29,080 --> 01:05:31,600
<font color="#ffffff">There was plenty of time to halt the</font>
<font color="#ffffff">experiment.</font>

930
01:05:31,600 --> 01:05:33,720
<font color="#ffff00">I gave orders the process be halted.</font>

931
01:05:33,720 --> 01:05:36,720
<font color="#00ffff">Too late. Sorry!</font>

932
01:05:36,720 --> 01:05:38,960
<font color="#00ff00">I'll kill him!</font>

933
01:05:38,960 --> 01:05:41,080
<font color="#ffffff">Who controls the transmutation</font>
<font color="#ffffff">experiment?</font>

934
01:05:41,080 --> 01:05:45,320
<font color="#ffff00">Mr Quillam, our technical director</font>
<font color="#ffff00">and principal devisor of programmes.</font>

935
01:05:45,320 --> 01:05:47,600
<font color="#00ffff">And controller of all that happens</font>

936
01:05:47,600 --> 01:05:51,040
<font color="#00ffff">in the People's Dome of</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Punishment and Correction.</font>

937
01:05:51,040 --> 01:05:54,360
<font color="#00ff00">Areta! Do something!</font>

938
01:05:54,360 --> 01:05:56,720
<font color="#ffff00">It's probably too late.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Only "probably"?</font>

939
01:05:56,720 --> 01:05:58,240
<font color="#00ffff">It is an unstable process.</font>

940
01:05:58,240 --> 01:06:01,280
<font color="#00ffff">Even I am not quite certain as to</font>
<font color="#00ffff">how it works, exactly.</font>

941
01:06:01,280 --> 01:06:02,480
<font color="#ffffff">That beam that radiates,</font>

942
01:06:02,480 --> 01:06:04,600
<font color="#ffffff">what source of energy</font>
<font color="#ffffff">does it derive from?</font>

943
01:06:04,600 --> 01:06:10,000
<font color="#00ffff">The nuclear bombardment beams</font>
<font color="#00ffff">release all the power</font>
<font color="#00ffff">latent in the recipient's mind.</font>

944
01:06:10,000 --> 01:06:12,840
<font color="#00ffff">If the changelings see themselves</font>
<font color="#00ffff">as unworthy,</font>

945
01:06:12,840 --> 01:06:16,200
<font color="#00ffff">they can become serpentine</font>
<font color="#00ffff">or reptilian.</font>

946
01:06:16,200 --> 01:06:20,880
<font color="#00ffff">She, for instance, must wish to fly</font>
<font color="#00ffff">away from trouble as would a bird.</font>

947
01:06:20,880 --> 01:06:23,240
<font color="#ffff00">It's an offshoot of our mining</font>
<font color="#ffff00">technology.</font>

948
01:06:23,240 --> 01:06:25,480
<font color="#ffff00">We found our miners</font>
<font color="#ffff00">growing fur and claws,</font>

949
01:06:25,480 --> 01:06:27,440
<font color="#ffff00">the better they thought to dig with.</font>

950
01:06:27,440 --> 01:06:30,120
<font color="#ffffff">How can the process be reversed?</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Who knows?</font>

951
01:06:30,120 --> 01:06:32,400
<font color="#00ffff">We don't require such findings here.</font>

952
01:06:32,400 --> 01:06:35,760
<font color="#ffffff">And you call yourself</font>
<font color="#ffffff">a research scientist?!</font>

953
01:06:35,760 --> 01:06:39,760
<font color="#00ffff">Certainly, which is why this trial</font>
<font color="#00ffff">must continue.</font>

954
01:06:39,760 --> 01:06:41,320
<font color="#00ffff">An experiment like this has never</font>

955
01:06:41,320 --> 01:06:43,280
<font color="#00ffff">been so advanced or</font>
<font color="#00ffff">so successful before.</font>

956
01:06:43,280 --> 01:06:46,440
<font color="#ffffff">Turn off the machine! They might</font>
<font color="#ffffff">still be restored to normality!</font>

957
01:06:46,440 --> 01:06:50,360
<font color="#ffff00">Mr Quillam, I make formal request.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">I am Section Controller.</font>

958
01:06:50,360 --> 01:06:54,600
<font color="#00ffff">A permanent position.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">No-one orders me!</font>

959
01:06:54,600 --> 01:07:00,200
<font color="#00ffff">Certainly not a transient Governor</font>
<font color="#00ffff">in the twilight of his reign.</font>

960
01:07:00,200 --> 01:07:03,120
<font color="#ffffff">Who decides the authority</font>
<font color="#ffffff">of command?</font>

961
01:07:03,120 --> 01:07:05,680
<font color="#ffff00">The regulations hand it to the</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Officer Guard, by long tradition.</font>

962
01:07:05,680 --> 01:07:08,720
<font color="#ffffff">But it can be changed?</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Not by him!</font>

963
01:07:08,720 --> 01:07:11,520
<font color="#ffff00">You have held your position for too</font>
<font color="#ffff00">long, Mr Quillam,</font>

964
01:07:11,520 --> 01:07:13,280
<font color="#ffff00">that becomes ever more obvious.</font>

965
01:07:13,280 --> 01:07:18,680
<font color="#00ffff">No-one has the nerve or the will</font>
<font color="#00ffff">to wrest it from me...</font>

966
01:07:18,680 --> 01:07:21,080
<font color="#00ffff">..Mr Governor, sir.</font>

967
01:07:21,080 --> 01:07:24,120
<font color="#ffffff">Do you still experiment</font>
<font color="#ffffff">on your own person?</font>

968
01:07:24,120 --> 01:07:25,720
<font color="#00ffff">No any more, why?</font>

969
01:07:25,720 --> 01:07:30,000
<font color="#ffffff">But in the past you exposed yourself</font>
<font color="#ffffff">to much danger, I think.</font>

970
01:07:30,000 --> 01:07:34,440
<font color="#00ffff">Yes. Why do you ask?</font>
<font color="#00ffff">How do you know?</font>

971
01:07:34,440 --> 01:07:37,400
<font color="#ffffff">Your mask!</font>

972
01:07:40,960 --> 01:07:42,520
<font color="#00ff00">Hold it!</font>

973
01:07:42,520 --> 01:07:44,400
<font color="#ffffff">Gun!</font>

974
01:07:44,400 --> 01:07:46,320
<font color="#ffffff">Thank you!</font>

975
01:07:47,880 --> 01:07:50,080
<font color="#ffffff">Turn off the transmutation process!</font>

976
01:07:50,080 --> 01:07:55,200
<font color="#00ffff">Take your choice! There must be</font>
<font color="#00ffff">100 switches to choose from,</font>

977
01:07:55,200 --> 01:07:59,200
<font color="#00ffff">if it's a switch that controls</font>
<font color="#00ffff">the bombardment beams.</font>

978
01:07:59,200 --> 01:08:01,960
<font color="#00ff00">Doctor, can you decide which?</font>

979
01:08:01,960 --> 01:08:03,360
<font color="#ffffff">No time.</font>

980
01:08:07,880 --> 01:08:10,440
<font color="#ffffff">QUILLAM YELLS</font>

981
01:08:10,440 --> 01:08:12,080
<font color="#ffffff">You, out!</font>

982
01:08:25,600 --> 01:08:28,760
<font color="#ffffff">ALARM BLARES</font>

983
01:08:28,760 --> 01:08:30,640
<font color="#ffffff">That won't be necessary!</font>

984
01:08:30,640 --> 01:08:32,480
<font color="#ffffff">Keys.</font>

985
01:08:32,480 --> 01:08:34,560
<font color="#ffffff">Thank you. Out!</font>

986
01:08:34,560 --> 01:08:36,920
<font color="#ffffff">ALARM CONTINUES</font>

987
01:08:43,400 --> 01:08:45,200
<font color="#ffffff">ALARM STOPS</font>

988
01:08:57,160 --> 01:08:58,680
<font color="#ffffff">We must have stopped the process</font>

989
01:08:58,680 --> 01:09:00,920
<font color="#ffffff">before the final transformation</font>
<font color="#ffffff">was complete.</font>

990
01:09:00,920 --> 01:09:02,680
<font color="#ffffff">Without the final phase bombardment,</font>

991
01:09:02,680 --> 01:09:05,000
<font color="#ffffff">their bodily metabolism is</font>
<font color="#ffffff">reasserting itself.</font>

992
01:09:05,000 --> 01:09:08,160
<font color="#ffffff">The guards must return soon.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">You said there's an escape exit?</font>

993
01:09:08,160 --> 01:09:10,600
<font color="#ffff00">On the other side of the Dome,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">but from here, it's impossible!</font>

994
01:09:10,600 --> 01:09:12,800
<font color="#ffffff">Not now! The odds are unpredictable.</font>

995
01:09:12,800 --> 01:09:16,600
<font color="#ffffff">With the Control Centre damaged,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">we may yet have an outside chance.</font>

996
01:09:16,600 --> 01:09:19,000
<font color="#ffffff">We must move on!</font>
<font color="#ffff00">What, leave them here?</font>

997
01:09:19,000 --> 01:09:21,240
<font color="#ffffff">No, take them with us.</font>

998
01:09:23,160 --> 01:09:25,960
<font color="#ffffff">Peri! Peri, can you hear me?</font>

999
01:09:25,960 --> 01:09:28,640
<font color="#ffff00">Areta!</font><font color="#ffffff"> Can you move, Peri?</font>

1000
01:09:28,640 --> 01:09:30,040
<font color="#ffffff">Try!</font>

1001
01:09:32,440 --> 01:09:35,600
<font color="#ffffff">You are...Peri!</font>

1002
01:09:35,600 --> 01:09:37,600
<font color="#ffffff">Peri!</font>

1003
01:09:37,600 --> 01:09:41,040
<font color="#00ffff">Peri?</font><font color="#ffffff"> I am the Doctor</font>
<font color="#ffffff">and you are Peri!</font>

1004
01:09:41,040 --> 01:09:44,960
<font color="#ffffff">Perpugilliam Brown!</font><font color="#00ffff"> Peri?</font>

1005
01:09:44,960 --> 01:09:47,080
<font color="#ffffff">It's a question of re-imprinting</font>
<font color="#ffffff">their identities,</font>

1006
01:09:47,080 --> 01:09:48,600
<font color="#ffffff">of establishing again who they are.</font>

1007
01:09:48,600 --> 01:09:50,560
<font color="#ffff00">Wake up, Areta, come on!</font>

1008
01:09:50,560 --> 01:09:52,560
<font color="#ffffff">Can you walk, Peri? Come on, try!</font>

1009
01:09:54,320 --> 01:09:56,880
<font color="#00ffff">I thought I could fly!</font>

1010
01:09:56,880 --> 01:10:00,000
<font color="#ffffff">Walking is all that's required for</font>
<font color="#ffffff">now. Come on, Peri. Walk!</font>

1011
01:10:01,840 --> 01:10:03,440
<font color="#00ff00">There's no control.</font>

1012
01:10:03,440 --> 01:10:05,640
<font color="#00ff00">All maintenance reports confirm</font>

1013
01:10:05,640 --> 01:10:08,600
<font color="#00ff00">the attack damaged a large number of</font>
<font color="#00ff00">operating circuits.</font>

1014
01:10:08,600 --> 01:10:11,720
<font color="#00ff00">The effects are impossible to</font>
<font color="#00ff00">control.</font>

1015
01:10:11,720 --> 01:10:14,080
<font color="#00ffff">Why not shut off all the power?</font>

1016
01:10:14,080 --> 01:10:17,160
<font color="#00ff00">And allow every prisoner in the Dome</font>
<font color="#00ff00">to escape, including this Doctor?</font>

1017
01:10:17,160 --> 01:10:20,600
<font color="#00ff00">Oh, no. I want them delivered to me.</font>

1018
01:10:20,600 --> 01:10:23,800
<font color="#00ffff">The screens are still showing</font>
<font color="#00ffff">scenes from the Punishment Domes.</font>

1019
01:10:23,800 --> 01:10:25,800
<font color="#00ff00">And they'll continue to do so.</font>

1020
01:10:25,800 --> 01:10:28,320
<font color="#00ff00">It's the only way we have</font>
<font color="#00ff00">of assessing the effects</font>

1021
01:10:28,320 --> 01:10:32,680
<font color="#00ff00">of the damage done.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">This Doctor must be eliminated!</font>

1022
01:10:32,680 --> 01:10:35,080
<font color="#00ffff">He smells the truth of things!</font>

1023
01:10:35,080 --> 01:10:38,800
<font color="#00ff00">The Dome will take care of him.</font>

1024
01:11:11,640 --> 01:11:13,080
<font color="#ffff00">Doctor?</font>

1025
01:11:17,560 --> 01:11:19,520
<font color="#ffffff">GUN BLASTS</font>

1026
01:11:21,080 --> 01:11:23,040
<font color="#ffffff">Cover me, I'll get the girls!</font>

1027
01:11:25,360 --> 01:11:27,000
<font color="#ffffff">GUN BLASTS</font>

1028
01:11:29,480 --> 01:11:31,560
<font color="#ffffff">Areta!</font>

1029
01:11:32,920 --> 01:11:36,320
<font color="#ffffff">Where's Peri? Where's Peri gone,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Areta?</font>

1030
01:11:50,920 --> 01:11:52,920
<font color="#ffffff">Quick, Jondar!</font>

1031
01:12:02,800 --> 01:12:05,160
<font color="#00ffff">That's more like it!</font>

1032
01:12:05,160 --> 01:12:07,200
<font color="#00ff00">I thought he was dead!</font>

1033
01:12:07,200 --> 01:12:10,240
<font color="#00ffff">No. Pay attention.</font>

1034
01:12:10,240 --> 01:12:11,960
<font color="#ffffff">SHE SIGHS, HE CHUCKLES</font>

1035
01:12:13,360 --> 01:12:17,520
<font color="#00ffff">My insulted person</font>
<font color="#00ffff">can stand no more!</font>

1036
01:12:17,520 --> 01:12:23,080
<font color="#00ffff">Either you sign the newly agreed</font>
<font color="#00ffff">price for the Zeiton ore,</font>

1037
01:12:23,080 --> 01:12:28,120
<font color="#00ffff">or I will leave you</font>
<font color="#00ffff">and the Varosian people</font>

1038
01:12:28,120 --> 01:12:32,520
<font color="#00ffff">to starve on this miserablest</font>
<font color="#00ffff">of planets,</font>

1039
01:12:32,520 --> 01:12:34,880
<font color="#00ffff">with nothing to eat</font>

1040
01:12:34,880 --> 01:12:39,000
<font color="#00ffff">except unsold Zeiton!</font>

1041
01:12:39,000 --> 01:12:41,520
<font color="#ffff00">You are in no position</font>
<font color="#ffff00">to threaten me now.</font>

1042
01:12:44,560 --> 01:12:47,400
<font color="#00ff00">Found wandering near Prison Control.</font>

1043
01:12:49,720 --> 01:12:52,560
<font color="#00ff00">I brought her here to display</font>
<font color="#00ff00">as evidence before the people.</font>

1044
01:12:52,560 --> 01:12:56,000
<font color="#ffff00">I will decide when and if</font>
<font color="#ffff00">I broadcast.</font>

1045
01:12:56,000 --> 01:12:58,000
<font color="#00ff00">Not any more!</font>

1046
01:13:01,920 --> 01:13:03,760
<font color="#00ff00">The regulations have a clause</font>

1047
01:13:03,760 --> 01:13:06,280
<font color="#00ff00">for just the situation</font>
<font color="#00ff00">that we are in now.</font>

1048
01:13:06,280 --> 01:13:11,160
<font color="#00ff00">At the end of every Governor's term,</font>
<font color="#00ff00">there comes a time of disapproval,</font>

1049
01:13:11,160 --> 01:13:14,440
<font color="#00ff00">where the people tire of his</font>
<font color="#00ff00">incompetence -</font>

1050
01:13:14,440 --> 01:13:16,360
<font color="#00ff00">the wish to vote him down.</font>

1051
01:13:16,360 --> 01:13:20,080
<font color="#ffff00">The wish to see all the cells</font>
<font color="#ffff00">of his body destroyed.</font>

1052
01:13:20,080 --> 01:13:22,000
<font color="#00ff00">When the final vote is avoided,</font>

1053
01:13:22,000 --> 01:13:25,880
<font color="#00ff00">the Chief Officer is empowered</font>
<font color="#00ff00">to insist on a final vote.</font>

1054
01:13:27,400 --> 01:13:29,600
<font color="#00ff00">You must accept full responsibility</font>

1055
01:13:29,600 --> 01:13:32,160
<font color="#00ff00">for failing to quell the</font>
<font color="#00ff00">prison rebellion</font>

1056
01:13:32,160 --> 01:13:35,560
<font color="#00ff00">led by this woman and her companion,</font>
<font color="#00ff00">the Doctor.</font>

1057
01:13:37,360 --> 01:13:41,200
<font color="#00ff00">Prepare for your final</font>
<font color="#00ff00">broadcast...Governor.</font>

1058
01:13:41,200 --> 01:13:43,040
<font color="#ffffff">SIL LAUGHS</font>

1059
01:13:53,080 --> 01:13:55,480
<font color="#ffffff">We must find Peri!</font>
<font color="#ffff00">She could be anywhere.</font>

1060
01:14:03,760 --> 01:14:08,440
<font color="#ffff00">Here we will die, as have so many</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Governors.</font>

1061
01:14:08,440 --> 01:14:10,800
<font color="#ffff00">The Chief will broadcast first.</font>

1062
01:14:10,800 --> 01:14:14,960
<font color="#ffff00">Anything I say after that</font>
<font color="#ffff00">will seem like bluster and lies.</font>

1063
01:14:14,960 --> 01:14:17,960
<font color="#ffffff">C-Can I speak? Can I say</font>
<font color="#ffffff">what I know?</font>

1064
01:14:17,960 --> 01:14:21,760
<font color="#ffff00">The ramblings of someone deranged by</font>
<font color="#ffff00">the transmogrification process.</font>

1065
01:14:21,760 --> 01:14:23,160
<font color="#ffffff">But I'm fine now!</font>

1066
01:14:24,560 --> 01:14:26,560
<font color="#ffff00">We have no hope.</font>

1067
01:14:27,720 --> 01:14:29,880
<font color="#ffffff">How long?</font>

1068
01:14:29,880 --> 01:14:32,800
<font color="#ffff00">As soon as the Chief</font>
<font color="#ffff00">assembles the Officer Guard.</font>

1069
01:14:32,800 --> 01:14:35,960
<font color="#ffff00">The regulations insist that the</font>
<font color="#ffff00">12 most senior officers</font>

1070
01:14:35,960 --> 01:14:39,760
<font color="#ffff00">place their names in hazard.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">The Chief draws a name,</font>

1071
01:14:39,760 --> 01:14:44,760
<font color="#ffff00">and the unlucky winner is brought in</font>
<font color="#ffff00">here and forced to govern.</font>

1072
01:14:44,760 --> 01:14:46,800
<font color="#ffffff">In fear of suffering</font>
<font color="#ffffff">the same death.</font>

1073
01:14:48,160 --> 01:14:52,120
<font color="#ffff00">Yes, the theory being</font>
<font color="#ffff00">that a man scared for his life</font>

1074
01:14:52,120 --> 01:14:55,880
<font color="#ffff00">will find solutions to this</font>
<font color="#ffff00">planet's problems.</font>

1075
01:14:55,880 --> 01:14:58,080
<font color="#ffff00">Except the poor unfortunate</font>
<font color="#ffff00">will discover</font>

1076
01:14:58,080 --> 01:14:59,720
<font color="#ffff00">there are no popular solutions</font>

1077
01:14:59,720 --> 01:15:03,960
<font color="#ffff00">to the difficulties he will find</font>
<font color="#ffff00">waiting for him here.</font>

1078
01:15:03,960 --> 01:15:07,320
<font color="#ffffff">It's crazy! Cruel!</font>

1079
01:15:07,320 --> 01:15:09,400
<font color="#ffff00">It's Varos.</font>

1080
01:15:15,240 --> 01:15:18,440
<font color="#ffff00">Maldak, isn't it?</font><font color="#00ffff"> Yes, sir.</font>

1081
01:15:22,840 --> 01:15:26,160
<font color="#ffff00">Put your gun down, I have</font>
<font color="#ffff00">no intention of trying to escape.</font>

1082
01:15:26,160 --> 01:15:28,320
<font color="#00ffff">Can't do that, sir.</font>

1083
01:15:28,320 --> 01:15:30,920
<font color="#ffff00">Weren't you elected to the</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Officer Guard</font>

1084
01:15:30,920 --> 01:15:33,200
<font color="#ffff00">when my name was drawn as Governor?</font>

1085
01:15:33,200 --> 01:15:35,360
<font color="#00ffff">Correct, sir.</font>

1086
01:15:35,360 --> 01:15:39,240
<font color="#ffff00">Might I ask one favour?</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Let the girl go free.</font>

1087
01:15:39,240 --> 01:15:41,360
<font color="#00ffff">I can't do that, sir.</font>

1088
01:15:44,880 --> 01:15:47,360
<font color="#ffff00">You know that soon I will be</font>
<font color="#ffff00">destroyed?</font>

1089
01:15:47,360 --> 01:15:49,760
<font color="#ffff00">Soon a new Governor will</font>
<font color="#ffff00">be elected.</font>

1090
01:15:49,760 --> 01:15:51,960
<font color="#00ffff">That is the custom, sir.</font>

1091
01:15:51,960 --> 01:15:54,480
<font color="#ffff00">What if the name they draw is yours?</font>

1092
01:15:54,480 --> 01:15:56,320
<font color="#ffff00">You've witnessed how impossible</font>
<font color="#ffff00">the system is.</font>

1093
01:15:56,320 --> 01:15:58,000
<font color="#ffff00">You're an intelligent man.</font>

1094
01:15:58,000 --> 01:16:02,480
<font color="#ffff00">The regulations are archaic,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">distorted, unworkable.</font>

1095
01:16:03,640 --> 01:16:06,040
<font color="#ffff00">Even if you're not chosen,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">an enquiry will be called.</font>

1096
01:16:06,040 --> 01:16:08,200
<font color="#ffff00">New Governors always have enquiries.</font>

1097
01:16:08,200 --> 01:16:10,880
<font color="#ffff00">It was you, wasn't it? Who showed</font>
<font color="#ffff00">the Doctor and Jondar</font>

1098
01:16:10,880 --> 01:16:12,680
<font color="#ffff00">where the women were held captive.</font>

1099
01:16:12,680 --> 01:16:17,280
<font color="#00ffff">I couldn't help that, sir.</font><font color="#ffff00"> They'll</font>
<font color="#ffff00">say you should have resisted.</font>

1100
01:16:18,720 --> 01:16:20,640
<font color="#00ffff">Just what is it that you want?</font>

1101
01:16:20,640 --> 01:16:23,320
<font color="#ffff00">For you to turn your back,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">let us go,</font>

1102
01:16:23,320 --> 01:16:26,160
<font color="#ffff00">find the Doctor, who has words</font>
<font color="#ffff00">and perhaps knowledge</font>

1103
01:16:26,160 --> 01:16:30,000
<font color="#ffff00">which might bring salvation</font>
<font color="#ffff00">to everyone -</font>

1104
01:16:30,000 --> 01:16:33,680
<font color="#ffff00">except the Chief and his cronies.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">No, sir, I can't do that.</font>

1105
01:16:35,000 --> 01:16:38,320
<font color="#ffff00">And Peri?</font><font color="#00ffff"> No, sir. I'm sorry.</font>

1106
01:16:39,800 --> 01:16:43,640
<font color="#ffff00">At least, when the vote</font>
<font color="#ffff00">goes against me</font>

1107
01:16:43,640 --> 01:16:47,840
<font color="#ffff00">and the human cell disintegrator</font>
<font color="#ffff00">beams pour down...</font>

1108
01:16:47,840 --> 01:16:49,800
<font color="#ffff00">..kill Peri, please...</font>

1109
01:16:49,800 --> 01:16:51,920
<font color="#ffff00">..to spare her from the</font>
<font color="#ffff00">rehabilitators.</font>

1110
01:17:08,520 --> 01:17:10,600
<font color="#ffff00">I tried.</font>

1111
01:17:15,280 --> 01:17:17,280
<font color="#ffff00">We will die together.</font>

1112
01:17:21,200 --> 01:17:24,120
<font color="#ffffff">BUGGY POWERS DOWN</font>

1113
01:17:27,200 --> 01:17:28,560
<font color="#ffff00">It's no good!</font>

1114
01:17:28,560 --> 01:17:31,280
<font color="#ffffff">Where are we?</font><font color="#ffff00"> I don't know.</font>

1115
01:17:31,280 --> 01:17:33,320
<font color="#ffffff">I wonder why we've been allowed</font>
<font color="#ffffff">to progress so far</font>

1116
01:17:33,320 --> 01:17:35,080
<font color="#ffffff">into the Dome without being</font>
<font color="#ffffff">apprehended?</font>

1117
01:17:35,080 --> 01:17:36,520
<font color="#00ffff">This place is cracking up!</font>

1118
01:17:36,520 --> 01:17:38,680
<font color="#00ffff">The guards must be as confused</font>
<font color="#00ffff">as we are.</font>

1119
01:17:38,680 --> 01:17:40,880
<font color="#ffff00">I think we're into what they call</font>
<font color="#ffff00">the "endgame".</font>

1120
01:17:40,880 --> 01:17:42,640
<font color="#ffff00">Not many trialists reach this stage.</font>

1121
01:17:42,640 --> 01:17:45,200
<font color="#ffffff">Could that be where the escape exit</font>
<font color="#ffffff">would be?</font><font color="#ffff00"> Presumably.</font>

1122
01:17:45,200 --> 01:17:47,360
<font color="#ffffff">What are we waiting for?</font>

1123
01:17:47,360 --> 01:17:49,200
<font color="#ffffff">I must be cautious.</font>

1124
01:17:49,200 --> 01:17:53,160
<font color="#ffffff">From now on, I believe the mind</font>
<font color="#ffffff">games and jolly tricks are over.</font>

1125
01:17:53,160 --> 01:17:57,320
<font color="#ffffff">What we're entering now could be the</font>
<font color="#ffffff">area of most dangerous ordeal.</font>

1126
01:17:58,600 --> 01:18:01,520
<font color="#00ffff">This is a forced vote.</font>

1127
01:18:01,520 --> 01:18:05,920
<font color="#00ffff">I have explained my actions,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">the Governor must now explain his,</font>

1128
01:18:05,920 --> 01:18:10,520
<font color="#00ffff">and then you, my fellow Varosians,</font>

1129
01:18:10,520 --> 01:18:14,000
<font color="#00ffff">must use your vote and decide.</font>

1130
01:18:37,720 --> 01:18:42,040
<font color="#ffff00">I have addressed you many times,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">and you have seen other Governors</font>

1131
01:18:42,040 --> 01:18:46,000
<font color="#ffff00">approach the ultimate</font>
<font color="#ffff00">crisis point of their regime.</font>

1132
01:18:46,000 --> 01:18:49,960
<font color="#ffff00">The time of forced vote</font>
<font color="#ffff00">now is upon me.</font>

1133
01:18:51,120 --> 01:18:53,760
<font color="#ffff00">I am not afraid to die.</font>

1134
01:18:53,760 --> 01:18:55,800
<font color="#00ffff">Good!</font>

1135
01:18:55,800 --> 01:18:57,160
<font color="#00ff00">HEY!</font>

1136
01:19:03,200 --> 01:19:04,920
<font color="#ffffff">ELECTRICAL WHIRRING</font>

1137
01:19:06,760 --> 01:19:08,600
<font color="#ffffff">HE BREATHES RAPIDLY</font>

1138
01:19:08,600 --> 01:19:11,360
<font color="#ffffff">HE MOANS</font>

1139
01:19:15,040 --> 01:19:17,160
<font color="#ffff00">Your system is wrong!</font>

1140
01:19:17,160 --> 01:19:19,520
<font color="#ffff00">We sell ourselves...</font>

1141
01:19:19,520 --> 01:19:24,400
<font color="#ffff00">..cheaply for nothing</font>
<font color="#ffff00">to such as Sil and his like.</font>

1142
01:19:27,800 --> 01:19:31,440
<font color="#ffff00">I see my words mean nothing...</font>

1143
01:19:31,440 --> 01:19:37,280
<font color="#ffff00">..that you all wish the harsh system</font>
<font color="#ffff00">of Varos to continue.</font>

1144
01:19:37,280 --> 01:19:39,960
<font color="#ffff00">So be it!</font>

1145
01:19:39,960 --> 01:19:42,760
<font color="#ffffff">Isn't there anything I can do?</font><font color="#ffff00"> No!</font>

1146
01:19:47,480 --> 01:19:50,560
<font color="#ffffff">WHIRRING STOPS,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">GOVERNOR BREATHES DEEPLY</font>

1147
01:19:53,240 --> 01:19:57,080
<font color="#00ff00">NO! You've messed up</font>
<font color="#00ff00">the whole system!</font>

1148
01:19:57,080 --> 01:19:59,240
<font color="#00ff00">They'll be coming round for you!</font>

1149
01:19:59,240 --> 01:20:02,320
<font color="#00ff00">Voting twice and using someone</font>
<font color="#00ff00">else's voting box?</font>

1150
01:20:02,320 --> 01:20:05,240
<font color="#00ff00">Both criminal offences!</font>

1151
01:20:06,840 --> 01:20:09,000
<font color="#ffffff">We must find the Doctor!</font>

1152
01:20:09,000 --> 01:20:13,360
<font color="#00ffff">He's in the End Zone.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">He must be seeking the safe exit.</font>

1153
01:20:13,360 --> 01:20:17,720
<font color="#ffffff">Let's go there, then!</font><font color="#ffff00"> Not that way!</font>
<font color="#ffff00">There has to be another route.</font>

1154
01:20:17,720 --> 01:20:20,200
<font color="#00ffff">There is, the ventilation ducting!</font>

1155
01:20:20,200 --> 01:20:22,200
<font color="#ffff00">There's an outlet here.</font>

1156
01:20:22,200 --> 01:20:25,160
<font color="#00ffff">I once spent eight days down there</font>
<font color="#00ffff">searching for escaped prisoners.</font>

1157
01:20:25,160 --> 01:20:28,560
<font color="#00ffff">I know it only too well.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Come on, then!</font>

1158
01:20:56,240 --> 01:20:57,920
<font color="#ffffff">NO!</font>

1159
01:20:57,920 --> 01:21:03,800
<font color="#ffffff">Begone! You are shadows,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">insubstantial ghosts!</font>

1160
01:21:03,800 --> 01:21:06,760
<font color="#ffffff">We are real, you are not!</font>

1161
01:21:17,880 --> 01:21:20,240
<font color="#ffffff">I think perhaps we should</font>
<font color="#ffffff">try another route.</font>

1162
01:21:27,000 --> 01:21:29,200
<font color="#00ff00">Where is Governor?!</font>

1163
01:21:29,200 --> 01:21:32,120
<font color="#00ff00">Why is he still at life and liberty?</font>

1164
01:21:32,120 --> 01:21:36,040
<font color="#00ff00">Why is everything no longer</font>
<font color="#00ff00">as it was?</font>

1165
01:21:36,040 --> 01:21:38,480
<font color="#00ffff">We are still the power!</font>

1166
01:21:38,480 --> 01:21:41,760
<font color="#00ff00">Why not you both prove it?</font>

1167
01:21:47,720 --> 01:21:50,040
<font color="#ffff00">What did he die from?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">I don't know.</font>

1168
01:21:52,080 --> 01:21:55,920
<font color="#ffffff">His neck's swollen as if to burst.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Poison, perhaps?</font>

1169
01:21:55,920 --> 01:21:58,760
<font color="#00ffff">Taken or been given?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Perhaps neither.</font>

1170
01:21:58,760 --> 01:22:01,280
<font color="#ffff00">Doctor!</font>

1171
01:21:58,760 --> 01:22:01,280
<font color="#ffffff">MEN GROWL</font>

1172
01:22:02,320 --> 01:22:05,600
<font color="#00ffff">Fellow prisoners!</font><font color="#ffffff"> This is no time</font>
<font color="#ffffff">for speeches, Jondar!</font>

1173
01:22:05,600 --> 01:22:06,920
<font color="#ffff00">What shall we do?</font>

1174
01:22:07,920 --> 01:22:09,320
<font color="#ffffff">Run.</font>

1175
01:22:19,120 --> 01:22:20,880
<font color="#ffffff">Stop, Areta!</font>

1176
01:22:22,600 --> 01:22:26,720
<font color="#ffffff">If you value your lives,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">don't touch those tendrils!</font>

1177
01:22:26,720 --> 01:22:29,640
<font color="#ffffff">In, but don't allow one touch!</font>

1178
01:22:34,880 --> 01:22:36,880
<font color="#ffffff">THEY GROWL</font>

1179
01:22:36,880 --> 01:22:39,640
<font color="#00ffff">What do they want?</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Why do they want us?</font>

1180
01:22:39,640 --> 01:22:41,840
<font color="#ffffff">I noticed a pile of bones</font>
<font color="#ffffff">back there.</font>

1181
01:22:41,840 --> 01:22:44,040
<font color="#ffffff">I think we were</font>
<font color="#ffffff">on their dinner menu!</font>

1182
01:22:45,640 --> 01:22:47,760
<font color="#ffffff">HE GROANS</font>

1183
01:23:05,960 --> 01:23:08,960
<font color="#00ffff">Sh! Patrol car!</font>

1184
01:23:08,960 --> 01:23:11,120
<font color="#ffff00">We're trapped!</font>

1185
01:23:11,120 --> 01:23:14,280
<font color="#00ffff">What do we do?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">The best we can.</font>

1186
01:23:15,360 --> 01:23:17,920
<font color="#ffffff">Could you attach this string to that</font>
<font color="#ffffff">clump of vines</font>

1187
01:23:17,920 --> 01:23:19,360
<font color="#ffffff">without killing yourself?</font>

1188
01:23:49,640 --> 01:23:54,800
<font color="#00ffff">I see you have a keen interest</font>
<font color="#00ffff">in the flora of Varos, Doctor.</font>

1189
01:23:54,800 --> 01:23:57,200
<font color="#ffffff">Just a passing fancy!</font>

1190
01:23:57,200 --> 01:24:00,960
<font color="#00ff00">It'll pass faster than you think.</font>
<font color="#00ff00">Kill them!</font><font color="#00ffff"> Wait!</font>

1191
01:24:00,960 --> 01:24:06,600
<font color="#00ffff">This man has insulted me.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">He must suffer for my humiliation.</font>

1192
01:24:06,600 --> 01:24:09,200
<font color="#00ff00">This is no time for revenge.</font>
<font color="#00ff00">Kill them quickly!</font>

1193
01:24:09,200 --> 01:24:13,160
<font color="#00ffff">And deprive Varos of an example</font>
<font color="#00ffff">of how traitors are dealt with?</font>

1194
01:24:13,160 --> 01:24:17,400
<font color="#00ffff">The cameras are still functioning.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Let the show begin.</font>

1195
01:24:19,240 --> 01:24:22,880
<font color="#00ffff">I want to hear them scream...</font>

1196
01:24:22,880 --> 01:24:25,840
<font color="#00ffff">..until I'm deaf with pleasure.</font>

1197
01:24:25,840 --> 01:24:31,120
<font color="#00ffff">To see their limbs twist in</font>
<font color="#00ffff">excruciating agony.</font>

1198
01:24:31,120 --> 01:24:35,520
<font color="#00ffff">Ultimately their blood must gush</font>
<font color="#00ffff">and flow</font>

1199
01:24:35,520 --> 01:24:38,120
<font color="#00ffff">along the gutters of Varos!</font>

1200
01:24:38,120 --> 01:24:43,680
<font color="#00ffff">The whole planet must delight</font>
<font color="#00ffff">in their torture and death!</font>

1201
01:24:43,680 --> 01:24:47,040
<font color="#ffffff">An excellent scenario.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Not mad about the part!</font>

1202
01:24:47,040 --> 01:24:48,640
<font color="#00ffff">PROCEED!</font>

1203
01:24:48,640 --> 01:24:50,400
<font color="#ffffff">NOW!</font>

1204
01:24:50,400 --> 01:24:52,400
<font color="#ffffff">THEY SCREAM</font>

1205
01:25:01,560 --> 01:25:03,560
<font color="#ffffff">Let's get away from here.</font>

1206
01:25:15,560 --> 01:25:18,960
<font color="#ffffff">Stay where you are! Don't move!</font>

1207
01:25:18,960 --> 01:25:24,840
<font color="#ffff00">What is it?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Poison. One touch and...whoo!</font>

1208
01:25:24,840 --> 01:25:28,400
<font color="#ffff00">Poison ivy?</font><font color="#ffffff"> Something like that.</font>

1209
01:25:29,880 --> 01:25:33,280
<font color="#ffffff">It'd give you a very nasty rash.</font>

1210
01:25:33,280 --> 01:25:35,160
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, Doctor!</font>

1211
01:25:35,160 --> 01:25:39,520
<font color="#00ff00">Plenipotentiary Sil to Galatron</font>
<font color="#00ff00">Occupation Force Commander.</font>

1212
01:25:39,520 --> 01:25:43,080
<font color="#00ff00">Urgent need for instant invasion of</font>
<font color="#00ff00">Planet Varos</font>

1213
01:25:43,080 --> 01:25:47,080
<font color="#00ff00">to consolidate our interest.</font>
<font color="#00ff00">React immediately!</font>

1214
01:25:52,440 --> 01:25:54,160
<font color="#00ff00">Water me.</font>

1215
01:25:55,960 --> 01:25:58,120
<font color="#00ff00">I must look my best</font>

1216
01:25:58,120 --> 01:26:02,920
<font color="#00ff00">to assume the emperorship</font>
<font color="#00ff00">of this primitive planet.</font>

1217
01:26:02,920 --> 01:26:05,080
<font color="#00ff00">Gently! Gently!</font>

1218
01:26:05,080 --> 01:26:08,480
<font color="#00ff00">Take extreme care with my person</font>

1219
01:26:08,480 --> 01:26:12,920
<font color="#00ff00">if you wish to retain your skins.</font>

1220
01:26:16,120 --> 01:26:18,320
<font color="#00ff00">That's better!</font>

1221
01:26:20,520 --> 01:26:23,800
<font color="#00ff00">Mirror, mirror! Come on, mirror!</font>
<font color="#00ff00">MIRROR!</font>

1222
01:26:26,920 --> 01:26:31,640
<font color="#00ff00">Oh, yes, I will wear the mantle</font>

1223
01:26:31,640 --> 01:26:36,520
<font color="#00ff00">of power so, so handsomely!</font>

1224
01:26:42,520 --> 01:26:45,840
<font color="#00ff00">Ah! There you are!</font>

1225
01:26:46,920 --> 01:26:50,880
<font color="#00ff00">I called you here to inform you</font>

1226
01:26:50,880 --> 01:26:55,920
<font color="#00ff00">that a force of invasion</font>
<font color="#00ff00">is about to land.</font>

1227
01:26:55,920 --> 01:26:57,080
<font color="#ffffff">Really? From where?</font>

1228
01:26:57,080 --> 01:27:02,120
<font color="#00ff00">My home planet, from Thoros Beta.</font>

1229
01:27:02,120 --> 01:27:06,000
<font color="#00ff00">You had innumerable chances</font>
<font color="#00ff00">to settle with me, Governor.</font>

1230
01:27:06,000 --> 01:27:08,760
<font color="#00ff00">Now your people will work for me.</font>

1231
01:27:08,760 --> 01:27:13,080
<font color="#ffffff">I</font><font color="#00ff00"> will be Governor of Governors!</font>

1232
01:27:13,080 --> 01:27:17,440
<font color="#ffffff">I</font><font color="#00ff00"> will be Viceroy of Varos!</font>

1233
01:27:20,200 --> 01:27:23,920
<font color="#00ff00">The confirmation of my</font>
<font color="#00ff00">colonisation force!</font>

1234
01:27:26,920 --> 01:27:31,480
<font color="#ffff00">"Report of Zeiton-7 traces</font>
<font color="#ffff00">found on asteroid Biosculptor.</font>

1235
01:27:31,480 --> 01:27:34,920
<font color="#ffff00">"Invasion of Varos cancelled."</font>

1236
01:27:34,920 --> 01:27:37,000
<font color="#00ff00">AARGH!</font>

1237
01:27:39,200 --> 01:27:43,480
<font color="#ffffff">The ways of the ruler are fraught</font>
<font color="#ffffff">with uncertainty, are they not, Sil?</font>

1238
01:27:44,440 --> 01:27:46,960
<font color="#00ff00">Certainly...certainly!</font>

1239
01:27:46,960 --> 01:27:51,200
<font color="#ffff00">There's more. "New supplies of</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Zeiton-7 required urgently.</font>

1240
01:27:51,200 --> 01:27:53,400
<font color="#ffff00">"Start shipments immediately.</font>

1241
01:27:53,400 --> 01:27:57,560
<font color="#ffff00">"Pay any price asked by Varosians."</font>

1242
01:27:59,000 --> 01:28:03,640
<font color="#ffff00">Well, shall we commence negotiations</font>
<font color="#ffff00">from a reasonable base?</font>

1243
01:28:04,920 --> 01:28:06,720
<font color="#00ff00">Of what?</font>

1244
01:28:08,240 --> 01:28:10,000
<font color="#00ff00">Of what?</font>

1245
01:28:10,000 --> 01:28:12,080
<font color="#ffff00">20 credits per unit.</font>

1246
01:28:12,080 --> 01:28:16,240
<font color="#00ff00">20?! 20?! ARGH!</font>

1247
01:28:18,040 --> 01:28:21,440
<font color="#ffffff">I think he needs more than water,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Peri, eh?</font>

1248
01:28:21,440 --> 01:28:23,640
<font color="#00ffff">Like cyanide!</font>

1249
01:28:23,640 --> 01:28:26,320
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, come, Peri, where's your sense</font>
<font color="#ffffff">of justice?</font>

1250
01:28:26,320 --> 01:28:29,120
<font color="#00ffff">What about that transmogrifier thing</font>
<font color="#00ffff">he put me in?</font>

1251
01:28:29,120 --> 01:28:32,320
<font color="#ffffff">I think we'll leave the Varosians</font>

1252
01:28:32,320 --> 01:28:34,520
<font color="#ffffff">to work out their own idea of</font>
<font color="#ffffff">justice, Peri.</font>

1253
01:28:36,360 --> 01:28:38,520
<font color="#ffff00">I'm very grateful, Doctor.</font>

1254
01:28:38,520 --> 01:28:40,720
<font color="#ffff00">Varos is grateful.</font>

1255
01:28:40,720 --> 01:28:43,920
<font color="#ffff00">Is there nothing we can offer you</font>
<font color="#ffff00">in return?</font>

1256
01:28:43,920 --> 01:28:49,360
<font color="#ffffff">Well, er...a little Zeiton-7</font>
<font color="#ffffff">would be quite useful...</font>

1257
01:28:49,360 --> 01:28:51,400
<font color="#ffffff">..not to say essential.</font>

1258
01:28:51,400 --> 01:28:54,800
<font color="#ffff00">You shall have as much as you need.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Maldak will arrange it.</font>

1259
01:28:54,800 --> 01:28:56,960
<font color="#ffffff">Thank you.</font>

1260
01:28:56,960 --> 01:28:59,320
<font color="#ffffff">Goodbye!</font>

1261
01:28:59,320 --> 01:29:01,800
<font color="#ffff00">Ah, goodbye.</font>

1262
01:29:03,440 --> 01:29:05,720
<font color="#ffff00">Goodbye.</font><font color="#00ffff"> Goodbye.</font>

1263
01:29:05,720 --> 01:29:08,680
<font color="#00ff00">You...you can't leave me here!</font>

1264
01:29:08,680 --> 01:29:11,200
<font color="#ffffff">Now you see me...</font>

1265
01:29:11,200 --> 01:29:13,360
<font color="#ffffff">ECHOES:</font><font color="#00ff00"> ARGH!</font>

1266
01:29:16,560 --> 01:29:22,000
<font color="#ffff00">..And that, fellow citizens of</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Varos, is my vowed intention,</font>

1267
01:29:22,000 --> 01:29:26,600
<font color="#ffff00">for without justice</font>
<font color="#ffff00">and peace and tolerance,</font>

1268
01:29:26,600 --> 01:29:29,080
<font color="#ffff00">we have no future.</font>

1269
01:29:29,080 --> 01:29:32,200
<font color="#ffff00">I know you will all work</font>
<font color="#ffff00">as hard as I shall</font>

1270
01:29:32,200 --> 01:29:35,280
<font color="#ffff00">for a glorious tomorrow.</font>

1271
01:29:35,280 --> 01:29:38,640
<font color="#ffff00">Thank you for allowing me</font>
<font color="#ffff00">into your homes.</font>

1272
01:29:40,280 --> 01:29:41,320
<font color="#ffff00">Thank you.</font>

1273
01:29:46,240 --> 01:29:51,320
<font color="#ffffff">No more executions, torture.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Nothing!</font>

1274
01:29:51,320 --> 01:29:55,240
<font color="#ffff00">It's all changed. We're free!</font>

1275
01:29:55,240 --> 01:29:57,600
<font color="#ffffff">Are we?</font><font color="#ffff00"> Yes!</font>

1276
01:29:59,280 --> 01:30:01,280
<font color="#ffffff">What shall we do?</font>

1277
01:30:05,080 --> 01:30:07,160
<font color="#ffff00">Don't know.</font>

1278
01:30:07,160 --> 01:30:09,560
<font color="#ffffff">CRACKLING HISS</font>

1279
01:30:18,000 --> 01:30:19,520
<font color="#ffff00">Oh!</font>

1280
01:30:19,520 --> 01:30:22,280
<font color="#ffff00">I can feel them all over me again.</font>

1281
01:30:22,280 --> 01:30:23,920
<font color="#ffff00">Ugh!</font>

1282
01:30:23,920 --> 01:30:27,440
<font color="#ffffff">Some memories can be very prickly,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">even after all this time.</font>

1283
01:30:27,440 --> 01:30:29,640
<font color="#ffff00">It's not just that.</font>

1284
01:30:29,640 --> 01:30:31,920
<font color="#ffff00">I got back to Earth...</font>

1285
01:30:33,080 --> 01:30:34,720
<font color="#ffff00">..eventually.</font>

1286
01:30:34,720 --> 01:30:36,600
<font color="#ffff00">Have you been there lately?</font>

1287
01:30:36,600 --> 01:30:40,360
<font color="#ffff00">The 21st century -</font>
<font color="#ffff00">it feels like Varos.</font>

1288
01:30:40,360 --> 01:30:43,240
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, Sil would fit in well.</font>

1289
01:30:43,240 --> 01:30:47,000
<font color="#ffffff">Everything has its price,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">even the planet itself.</font>

1290
01:30:47,000 --> 01:30:51,000
<font color="#ffffff">But, Peri, do you see what I mean?</font>

1291
01:30:51,000 --> 01:30:54,360
<font color="#ffffff">The inhumanity of Varos</font>

1292
01:30:54,360 --> 01:30:57,560
<font color="#ffffff">and Sil's greedy manipulation</font>
<font color="#ffffff">of that</font>

1293
01:30:57,560 --> 01:31:01,040
<font color="#ffffff">helped to give you the fire</font>
<font color="#ffffff">to fight evil</font>

1294
01:31:01,040 --> 01:31:03,040
<font color="#ffffff">wherever you found it.</font>

1295
01:31:03,040 --> 01:31:06,400
<font color="#ffff00">You mean, they didn't turn me</font>
<font color="#ffff00">into a bird,</font>

1296
01:31:06,400 --> 01:31:09,160
<font color="#ffff00">they turned me into the</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Warrior Queen?</font>

1297
01:31:09,160 --> 01:31:12,800
<font color="#ffffff">Marrying King Yrcanos had something</font>
<font color="#ffffff">to do with that as well,</font>

1298
01:31:12,800 --> 01:31:14,480
<font color="#ffffff">but you see...</font>

1299
01:31:16,200 --> 01:31:18,320
<font color="#ffffff">..the universe can be chaos,</font>

1300
01:31:18,320 --> 01:31:20,360
<font color="#ffffff">but what it creates</font>

1301
01:31:20,360 --> 01:31:24,640
<font color="#ffffff">is ultimately always capable of</font>
<font color="#ffffff">being wonderful and good...</font>

1302
01:31:26,000 --> 01:31:29,320
<font color="#ffffff">..even on Earth...in the end.</font>

1303
01:31:29,320 --> 01:31:31,400
<font color="#ffffff">You'll see.</font>

1304
01:31:31,400 --> 01:31:32,840
<font color="#ffff00">Yeah.</font>

1305
01:31:32,840 --> 01:31:34,520
<font color="#ffff00">I get it.</font>

1306
01:31:34,520 --> 01:31:36,800
<font color="#ffffff">SHE BREATHES DEEPLY</font>

1307
01:31:36,800 --> 01:31:40,840
<font color="#ffff00">The two of us, we're</font>
<font color="#ffff00">warriors of the universe.</font>

1308
01:31:40,840 --> 01:31:43,520
<font color="#ffffff">Warriors of the universe?!</font>

1309
01:31:43,520 --> 01:31:45,320
<font color="#ffffff">HE CHUCKLES</font>

1310
01:31:45,320 --> 01:31:48,480
<font color="#ffffff">I like that. It has a ring to it.</font>

1311
01:31:50,800 --> 01:31:54,560
<font color="#ffffff">So, what do you think?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Where shall we save first?</font>

1312
01:31:54,560 --> 01:31:56,840
<font color="#ffff00">The Doctor and the Warrior Queen?</font>

1313
01:31:56,840 --> 01:32:01,480
<font color="#ffffff">Why not? We're older, but our</font>
<font color="#ffffff">stories are a long way from over.</font>

1314
01:32:01,480 --> 01:32:04,800
<font color="#ffff00">I guess those minstrel songs won't</font>
<font color="#ffff00">write themselves.</font>

1315
01:32:04,800 --> 01:32:07,200
<font color="#ffffff">We'll give them something to sing</font>
<font color="#ffffff">about.</font>

1316
01:32:07,200 --> 01:32:10,800
<font color="#ffff00">Just one thing.</font><font color="#ffffff"> What?</font>
<font color="#ffff00">I have to go back...</font>

1317
01:32:10,800 --> 01:32:14,320
<font color="#ffff00">..to Yrcanos's memorial. Can we do</font>
<font color="#ffff00">that? Once a year.</font>

1318
01:32:14,320 --> 01:32:16,800
<font color="#ffff00">Just to keep an eye on things.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">It's a deal!</font>

1319
01:32:16,800 --> 01:32:20,120
<font color="#ffff00">Right.</font><font color="#ffffff"> Meanwhile,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">there are worlds out there</font>

1320
01:32:20,120 --> 01:32:22,160
<font color="#ffffff">waiting for us to save them!</font>

1321
01:32:22,160 --> 01:32:25,800
<font color="#ffff00">So what are we waiting for?</font><font color="#ffffff"> Right,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">come on, then!</font><font color="#ffff00"> Yeah!</font>

1322
01:32:25,800 --> 01:32:28,040
<font color="#ffffff">BEEPING AND BLOOPING</font>

